1
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:59,780
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:31,830
A little pause... and we are back.

3
00:01:34,134 --> 00:01:38,150
Ah, just my luck to have lookout duty on a
day like today.

4
00:01:38,834 --> 00:01:41,430
What I really want is to watch the tuning
exam.

5
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,070
Oh, stop.

6
00:01:43,689 --> 00:01:45,790
The tuning exam takes place twice a year.

7
00:01:46,329 --> 00:01:47,529
You'll have plenty of chances.

8
00:01:48,154 --> 00:01:51,510
Yeah, but this year that kid from the
Uchiha clan is taking part, isn't he?

9
00:01:52,024 --> 00:01:53,470
I just hate to miss seeing that.

10
00:01:54,459 --> 00:01:56,370
Well, my life will be incomplete now.

11
00:01:58,290 --> 00:01:59,290
What's that?

12
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:06,370
What in the... Notify
Lord Hokage right away!

13
00:02:22,380 --> 00:02:24,100
You're not getting into this village!

14
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,560
Dispatch reinforcements!

15
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:39,660
Yes, sir!

16
00:02:55,500 --> 00:03:03,180
The operation has begun!

17
00:03:11,310 --> 00:03:12,490
Lord Hokage!

18
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:13,770
Leave it to me!

19
00:03:17,190 --> 00:03:18,190
Gaara!

20
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:22,830
Squad 1 above.

21
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:24,090
Squad 2 below.

22
00:03:24,270 --> 00:03:25,310
Protect the nobles.

23
00:03:32,530 --> 00:03:34,510
You will not interfere!

24
00:03:54,370 --> 00:03:56,030
Finally, it's my time.

25
00:03:56,370 --> 00:03:58,250
We've all been waiting for this.

26
00:03:58,530 --> 00:04:01,290
I was so frustrated hiding in that
disguise.

27
00:04:01,850 --> 00:04:03,190
You're all sweaty, too.

28
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,410
So gross.

29
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:07,010
Come on, we're all friends here,
right?

30
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,030
Sound Ninja.

31
00:04:11,410 --> 00:04:12,770
Right-o.

32
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:13,770
Let's go.

33
00:04:13,930 --> 00:04:15,410
We have to back up Lord Hokage.

34
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,630
Beware of traps.

35
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:17,850
Yes, sir.

36
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:19,290
Do it.

37
00:04:20,290 --> 00:04:21,290
Right.

38
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:24,470
Ninja Arts!

39
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,990
Four Flames Formation!

40
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,210
A barrier.

41
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:39,010
We have to figure it out.

42
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:40,750
How are we going to pass this without
dying?

43
00:04:40,790 --> 00:04:41,790
But how?

44
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,070
Lord Kazekage.

45
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:52,790
That's a barrier you need to do.

46
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:55,710
They outwitted the Anbu Black Ops.

47
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:58,330
And the Anbu are supposed to be the best.

48
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,950
Why are you here?

49
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:04,250
Lord Hokage is in danger.

50
00:05:14,470 --> 00:05:15,990
What a nuisance.

51
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:19,530
An enemy masquerading as Anbu Black Ops.

52
00:05:20,570 --> 00:05:22,790
So he was using genjutsu.

53
00:05:23,130 --> 00:05:24,730
Yes, there's no mistake.

54
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:29,610
What's going on here?

55
00:05:30,630 --> 00:05:31,630
Stop it, Gaara!

56
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:35,670
I must kill him.

57
00:05:36,230 --> 00:05:38,790
There's no point in continuing this fight.

58
00:05:39,030 --> 00:05:39,690
That's right.

59
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:40,900
Don't forget our mission.

60
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:42,430
Out of my way.

61
00:05:43,250 --> 00:05:45,350
What are you three doing now?

62
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,990
Can't you see the operation's already
underway?

63
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:01,460
What is going on?

64
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,520
Tell me!

65
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Gaara!

66
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,320
What's wrong?

67
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:13,060
His wound's worse than I thought.

68
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,880
And his chakra is almost completely
drained away.

69
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:16,820
You fool!

70
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:20,780
It's all because you tried to transform
before the signal was given.

71
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:22,440
So what do we do now?

72
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,460
We need Gaara for this!

73
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,240
Alright.

74
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:31,660
For now, you two take Gaara and tend to
his wounds.

75
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:36,240
As soon as his chakra has been restored,
the operation will continue.

76
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,400
You got it.

77
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:42,180
And you, Sensei?

78
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:44,700
I'm going to take care of these guys.

79
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,540
Yes.

80
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:46,820
Right.

81
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:53,300
And is the host of this party Orochimaru?

82
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,080
Don't know.

83
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,960
And don't care.

84
00:06:58,260 --> 00:07:00,020
Now let's heat things up, huh?

85
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:04,500
Sasuke.

86
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,040
I'm sorry.

87
00:07:07,041 --> 00:07:09,980
But the tuning exam ends here for you.

88
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,960
You've already achieved tuning level.

89
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,900
You're a Leaf Village shinobi.

90
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,840
So put your training to good use.

91
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:22,140
In other words, I'm supposed to take down
Gaara, right?

92
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:23,640
Our match continues?

93
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:25,360
Just be careful.

94
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,140
It's the real thing now.

95
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,740
Not a match.

96
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:32,080
What I must do... is the same.

97
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,840
Not so fast!

98
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,880
Aw, you take me down now!

99
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:42,900
They won't believe us anyway!

100
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:43,940
Sasuke...

101
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,480
Well well well.

102
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:51,040
We had intended to capture Sasuke while
Gaara was causing trouble.

103
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:56,080
But I suppose not everything goes as
planned, does it?

104
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:58,540
Garo... I see!

105
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:00,720
So that was the plan.

106
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:06,840
Then the Hidden Leaf Village... And
Sasuke were your targets, is that correct?

107
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:07,460
Ha!

108
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,860
Do you really think that the Leaf Village
is so important?

109
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:16,160
Now, if Gaara returns, I'll be able to
show you something very interesting.

110
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:18,520
Very interesting indeed.

111
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:25,301
But anyway, your stubbornness and incompetence
have allowed me to outmaneuver you.

112
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,020
I've defeated you.

113
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,040
Hmph.

114
00:08:29,041 --> 00:08:31,840
Nothing is decided until the very end.

115
00:08:31,841 --> 00:08:34,980
I taught you that years ago, didn't I?

116
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,840
Orochimaru...

117
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:44,740
I knew, or at least thought, this day
would eventually arrive.

118
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,320
However...

119
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:51,160
You're not going to defeat me that easily.

120
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,960
I told you, didn't I?

121
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:58,220
You should have picked the fifth Hokage
before now.

122
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,320
Because third Hokage...

123
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:05,260
Right here... Right now,
you are going to die.

124
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:12,800
Orochimaru... What should we do?

125
00:09:13,154 --> 00:09:14,640
Should we send in reinforcements?

126
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
No.

127
00:09:16,484 --> 00:09:18,780
It's risky to act when we don't know the
whole situation.

128
00:09:20,069 --> 00:09:23,480
And if Orochimaru's behind all this,
even more so.

129
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:28,880
Is Orochimaru... I mean, is he really that
dangerous?

130
00:09:30,179 --> 00:09:31,520
When I was just a child...

131
00:09:32,389 --> 00:09:36,400
I saw him one time, and I... I had one
thought.

132
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,740
That he didn't seem human to me.

133
00:09:44,854 --> 00:09:47,880
That he was just some creature that had
taken on a human form.

134
00:09:49,545 --> 00:09:50,780
It was frightening.

135
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,640
Simply... frightening.

136
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,680
Sir, I have a report!

137
00:10:01,179 --> 00:10:03,303
Giant boas have appeared
near the eastern gate of

138
00:10:03,304 --> 00:10:05,821
the Leaf Village, and with
them a hundred sand ninja!

139
00:10:06,579 --> 00:10:08,266
They've infiltrated
our village, and are

140
00:10:08,267 --> 00:10:10,020
battling our shinobi
who are patrolling there!

141
00:10:10,329 --> 00:10:13,200
Leave behind squads one and two,
and head to the gate!

142
00:10:13,439 --> 00:10:14,060
Right now!

143
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:15,340
Yes, sir!

144
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:28,100
This is as far as you're going to get!

145
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:46,780
We've been careless.

146
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:49,340
And now even Lord Hokage...

147
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,260
Kakashi, look!

148
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,420
There, inside the barrier!

149
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,740
What is it?

150
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:03,760
Orochimaru...

151
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,280
Orochimaru!

152
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,940
Why is he here?

153
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:12,400
Don't tell me he's after Sasuke again!

154
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:15,040
Hey, Sasuke!

155
00:11:15,041 --> 00:11:16,041
Sasuke!

156
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,380
What?

157
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,440
He's... he's gone!

158
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:37,480
Sakura, just stay there while I trim the
enemy's numbers down to size.

159
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:40,380
Sasuke!

160
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:53,080
Nicely done.

161
00:11:53,260 --> 00:11:55,220
But I'm worried about Lord Hokage.

162
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,920
Leave that to the Anbu Black Ops.

163
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,460
We have enough to handle here.

164
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:03,180
Besides, Lord Hokage isn't just some
pushover, you know.

165
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:07,120
Yeah, but... Just remember, guy.

166
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,520
He is the Hokage.

167
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,080
He can handle it.

168
00:12:20,770 --> 00:12:24,470
Are you actually crying because you're so
happy?

169
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:29,050
Or is it that... inside your heart there
is sorrow?

170
00:12:29,450 --> 00:12:34,831
A feeling of unhappiness you can't shake as
you contemplate killing your old teacher?

171
00:12:47,330 --> 00:12:51,990
I was feeling so sleepy, but now it seems
I'm finally awake.

172
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:56,350
Yes, that's exactly what I was thinking.

173
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:05,270
And I was also thinking that you aren't
the kind of person who would hold a grudge.

174
00:13:05,271 --> 00:13:09,210
So it seems that you have neither a goal
nor a motive.

175
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:15,710
Huh... I guess... well, I guess that I do
kind of have a goal.

176
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:18,370
Let me see if I can explain it.

177
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:22,030
I find it very interesting to watch things
in motion.

178
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:26,090
I get no pleasure when the world is still.

179
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:29,150
Like a windmill that isn't turning.

180
00:13:29,470 --> 00:13:33,670
I suppose some might find it beautiful,
even if it's immobile.

181
00:13:33,671 --> 00:13:36,870
But to me, such a thing is truly boring.

182
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:41,510
So now, I want to put things in motion
myself.

183
00:13:41,990 --> 00:13:44,570
The first step is crushing the Leaf
Village.

184
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:46,590
Hmph.

185
00:13:46,591 --> 00:13:49,330
I see you haven't changed at all.

186
00:13:53,950 --> 00:13:54,950
Sakura.

187
00:13:56,610 --> 00:13:57,610
Sakura.

188
00:13:58,970 --> 00:14:03,650
It was worth teaching you genjutsu during
survival training for the genin exam.

189
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:06,910
You truly do have a talent for it.

190
00:14:07,730 --> 00:14:08,730
Huh?

191
00:14:09,370 --> 00:14:12,970
Release the genjutsu, and wake Naruto and
Shikamaru.

192
00:14:14,070 --> 00:14:15,750
Naruto will be delighted.

193
00:14:15,970 --> 00:14:18,490
You'll be getting a mission after such a
long time.

194
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:21,430
What kind of mission?

195
00:14:21,431 --> 00:14:23,850
You'll have to be careful on this one.

196
00:14:24,950 --> 00:14:28,650
It's the first A-rank assignment since the
Land of the Waves.

197
00:14:34,270 --> 00:14:37,830
I feel uneasy about that weird chakra.

198
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:50,770
But then, shouldn't we wake Ino and Choji
and go in a group?

199
00:14:50,771 --> 00:14:51,990
No time.

200
00:14:52,250 --> 00:14:56,990
I suspect that many sound and sand shinobi
may have already infiltrated this village.

201
00:14:58,429 --> 00:15:02,510
Besides, if you have more than the four
ninja essential to a squad, it takes

202
00:15:02,511 --> 00:15:06,510
longer to get anything done, and becomes
more difficult to hide from the enemy.

203
00:15:07,330 --> 00:15:10,730
You did learn that in academy patrol
training, didn't you?

204
00:15:11,530 --> 00:15:12,530
Of course.

205
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:16,850
With four squad members, that means you'll
be coming with us, right?

206
00:15:16,851 --> 00:15:17,450
No.

207
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:19,770
I must not leave this place.

208
00:15:20,590 --> 00:15:21,610
Summoning jutsu!

209
00:15:25,384 --> 00:15:28,090
Pakkun here will track down Sasuke by
scent.

210
00:15:29,835 --> 00:15:31,190
Wait, seriously?

211
00:15:31,909 --> 00:15:33,310
Our fourth member is a puppy?

212
00:15:36,674 --> 00:15:38,290
Alright, listen little girl.

213
00:15:38,609 --> 00:15:41,510
Don't you dare go around saying I'm just
some cute puppy.

214
00:15:42,764 --> 00:15:45,530
But... I didn't even say cute.

215
00:15:45,531 --> 00:15:47,170
Okay, it's time.

216
00:15:47,754 --> 00:15:49,670
Sakura, go release the genjutsu.

217
00:16:07,110 --> 00:16:08,110
Release!

218
00:16:15,650 --> 00:16:17,890
Hey, what's going on, Sakura?

219
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:19,830
Get down!

220
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:22,390
I'll fill you in later.

221
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:23,410
Just stay down.

222
00:16:29,025 --> 00:16:31,860
Shikamaru, you were... this whole time?

223
00:16:36,860 --> 00:16:39,560
You released genjutsu too, you faker!

224
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,320
Why were you pretending to be asleep this
whole time?

225
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,560
I didn't want to get involved.

226
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,440
Just give me a break.

227
00:16:46,700 --> 00:16:48,900
I couldn't care less about Sasuke.

228
00:16:57,160 --> 00:16:58,800
What is all this?

229
00:16:59,289 --> 00:17:00,860
We lied to you!

230
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:04,819
So fast!

231
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,140
Not just fast, powerful.

232
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,040
Gai-sensei!

233
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:16,240
Now, I'll explain the mission.

234
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,880
As soon as I do, go through that opening.

235
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:23,020
First, track down Sasuke and stop him.

236
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:26,020
Then find a safe location and await
further orders.

237
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,920
Did something happen to Sasuke?

238
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:31,220
I'll tell you what happened on the way.

239
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:32,820
Now, let's go!

240
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,960
Whoa!

241
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:35,500
Why me?

242
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:36,600
What a drag.

243
00:17:36,980 --> 00:17:38,100
Listen, whiner.

244
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:38,960
Huh?

245
00:17:39,380 --> 00:17:41,740
Look, if this mission
is a success, as a

246
00:17:41,741 --> 00:17:44,781
reward, I'll let you touch
my paw while my pads.

247
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,680
So there's no reason to sulk.

248
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:47,380
What?

249
00:17:47,381 --> 00:17:48,580
Come on.

250
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,660
They're really soft.

251
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,760
They're... what?

252
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,100
No one ever wants to shake.

253
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:59,060
But my paws are so soft and supple!

254
00:18:03,679 --> 00:18:04,300
Forget it.

255
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:05,380
Let's go.

256
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:13,240
Are they gonna be okay by themselves?

257
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,140
Yes, they'll be fine.

258
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:17,120
Pakkun will protect them.

259
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:20,080
As long as they don't go too far.

260
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:38,600
This barrier can only be broken from the
inside.

261
00:18:40,100 --> 00:18:44,600
If Lord Hokage would just take out one of
those sound ninja, then we could help.

262
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:48,040
Put up a barrier on the inside,
too.

263
00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:52,780
Hah!

264
00:19:01,930 --> 00:19:02,370
Hmm.

265
00:19:02,371 --> 00:19:05,050
Doesn't look like I'll be able to get out
of this easily.

266
00:19:06,250 --> 00:19:07,890
Of course it won't be easy.

267
00:19:08,130 --> 00:19:09,170
I know you.

268
00:19:09,410 --> 00:19:13,470
It would be a big bother if someone came
in here and got in your way, wouldn't it?

269
00:19:16,930 --> 00:19:17,930
Hehehehehehe.

270
00:19:18,590 --> 00:19:19,750
Come on.

271
00:19:20,189 --> 00:19:22,830
Something weird is going on.

272
00:19:23,539 --> 00:19:26,450
All the teachers left the students to
study by themselves.

273
00:19:27,389 --> 00:19:28,670
And then there's that smoke.

274
00:19:29,794 --> 00:19:32,030
It's coming from the direction of the
arena.

275
00:19:32,584 --> 00:19:33,584
Huh?

276
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:36,430
Do you guys see something over there,
too?

277
00:19:37,390 --> 00:19:39,490
I wonder what's going on today.

278
00:19:41,379 --> 00:19:43,410
Yeah, this is definitely weird.

279
00:19:43,844 --> 00:19:46,070
Right in the middle of a lesson and bam!

280
00:19:46,130 --> 00:19:47,350
We're just stuck in here by ourselves.

281
00:19:47,351 --> 00:19:50,110
And we've been in here so long!

282
00:19:50,450 --> 00:19:50,690
Yeah.

283
00:19:51,439 --> 00:19:53,490
Iruka-sensei and the others are late.

284
00:19:54,699 --> 00:19:55,730
Aren't they, Konohamaru?

285
00:19:56,810 --> 00:19:57,530
I know.

286
00:19:57,729 --> 00:19:59,209
I'm gonna play baseball after school.

287
00:20:00,459 --> 00:20:04,911
We've gotten information that several enemy
units have already infiltrated the village.

288
00:20:05,269 --> 00:20:06,269
Then we have no choice.

289
00:20:06,639 --> 00:20:08,999
We should evacuate the students to a safe
place immediately.

290
00:20:09,410 --> 00:20:10,410
Yes.

291
00:20:10,699 --> 00:20:14,010
But we have to do so in a way that doesn't
cause them all to panic.

292
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:14,750
Right.

293
00:20:15,249 --> 00:20:16,870
Okay, here's what we're all going to do.

294
00:20:17,169 --> 00:20:18,849
Tell them we're having an evacuation
drill.

295
00:20:22,870 --> 00:20:24,590
Did you foresee this?

296
00:20:24,650 --> 00:20:25,710
Dying this way?

297
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:04,840
Don't think I'll go easy on you just
because you're old and doddering.

298
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:07,980
I wouldn't want you to.

299
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:13,680
Now, depending on how good your jutsu is,
I might send you back to the academy.

300
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:18,860
At least try to make this an interesting
fight.

301
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:31,260
Jurikens Shadow Clone Jutsu!

302
00:21:36,300 --> 00:21:37,500
Summoning Jutsu!

303
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,160
Reanimation!

304
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:41,080
First!

305
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:44,200
A summoning jutsu used as a shield!

306
00:21:44,540 --> 00:21:46,500
And what he summoned is...

307
00:21:47,060 --> 00:21:48,060
Second!

308
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:51,820
I must stop the third at any cost!

309
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:53,360
Now's it!

310
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:07,280
So the third one failed, did it?

311
00:22:07,281 --> 00:22:09,720
Oh well, no matter.

312
00:22:21,520 --> 00:22:23,060
It can't be!

313
00:22:23,380 --> 00:22:25,100
Those people are... What?

314
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:26,320
They're what?

315
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:31,540
What are you going to do now,
Sarutobi-sensei?

316
00:22:32,040 --> 00:22:33,700
What can you do?

317
00:22:43,650 --> 00:22:46,530
It's been a very long time, Saru.

318
00:22:46,690 --> 00:22:48,290
Oh, it's you.

319
00:22:48,570 --> 00:22:50,790
You've gotten so old, Sarutobi.

320
00:22:51,470 --> 00:22:54,341
Never in my entire life
did I imagine I would have

321
00:22:54,342 --> 00:22:57,191
to face off against my
brethren in this manner.

322
00:22:58,030 --> 00:22:59,530
Please prepare yourselves.

323
00:23:00,290 --> 00:23:01,750
First Lord Hokage.

324
00:23:02,190 --> 00:23:03,790
Second Lord Hokage.

325
00:23:04,490 --> 00:23:06,110
A summoning jutsu.

326
00:23:06,610 --> 00:23:10,150
It seems that he used the forbidden
reanimation technique.

327
00:23:10,550 --> 00:23:11,830
How insolent.

328
00:23:13,750 --> 00:23:15,810
Then, Sarutobi, tell me.

329
00:23:15,950 --> 00:23:21,050
Does this summoning jutsu mean we're being
forced to battle against you?

330
00:23:21,370 --> 00:23:23,670
Enough with the reminiscing.

331
00:23:24,150 --> 00:23:26,550
It's time that we got started.

332
00:23:26,990 --> 00:23:30,250
Whenever you live, there's always war.

333
00:23:31,630 --> 00:23:32,790
Isn't it great?

334
00:23:33,530 --> 00:23:35,470
Nothing good can ever come of this!

335
00:23:35,650 --> 00:23:38,810
You've disrespected the dead and
manipulated time!

336
00:23:45,730 --> 00:23:47,370
So that's what happened!

337
00:23:48,350 --> 00:23:49,590
I get it.

338
00:23:49,591 --> 00:23:51,350
I guess Sasuke got all impatient.

339
00:23:51,990 --> 00:23:52,770
Oh, man.

340
00:23:52,970 --> 00:23:54,930
Why did you have to pull me into this
anyway?

341
00:23:55,210 --> 00:23:57,010
This whole thing is such a drag.

342
00:23:57,990 --> 00:23:59,610
It can't be helped, okay?

343
00:23:59,710 --> 00:24:01,230
It's Kakashi-sensei's order!

344
00:24:06,910 --> 00:24:07,910
This way!

345
00:24:09,490 --> 00:24:11,010
How long till we catch up?

346
00:24:11,730 --> 00:24:12,710
I don't know.

347
00:24:12,711 --> 00:24:15,590
A long time if they keep moving at this
pace.

348
00:24:16,010 --> 00:24:17,010
Come on!

349
00:24:42,510 --> 00:24:43,690
Come on, you guys!

350
00:24:43,790 --> 00:24:44,790
Hurry it up!

351
00:24:45,090 --> 00:24:45,970
What is it?

352
00:24:45,971 --> 00:24:47,710
Did you see Sasuke?

353
00:24:48,930 --> 00:24:49,490
No.

354
00:24:49,491 --> 00:24:51,430
There are two squads behind us.

355
00:24:51,490 --> 00:24:52,490
That's eight ninja.

356
00:24:52,730 --> 00:24:53,730
Wait.

357
00:24:54,170 --> 00:24:55,350
No, there's one more.

358
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:57,430
That's nine ninja following us.

359
00:24:57,750 --> 00:24:58,090
What?

360
00:24:58,490 --> 00:24:59,330
Oh, man.

361
00:24:59,470 --> 00:25:00,470
Come on already.

362
00:25:00,710 --> 00:25:02,150
Give me a break here.

363
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:12,930
They're probably all Chunin or higher.

364
00:25:13,550 --> 00:25:15,670
We'll be wiped out if they catch us.

365
00:25:16,510 --> 00:25:17,510
Wiped out?

366
00:25:18,090 --> 00:25:19,090
Listen, guys!

367
00:25:19,290 --> 00:25:20,730
We don't have much choice.

368
00:25:20,770 --> 00:25:22,210
We're gonna have to ambush them!

369
00:25:22,211 --> 00:25:23,370
An ambush?

370
00:25:23,930 --> 00:25:25,130
That could work.

371
00:25:26,090 --> 00:25:27,750
It would give us an advantage.

372
00:25:28,090 --> 00:25:31,348
Even if there are twice as
many of them as there are of us,

373
00:25:31,349 --> 00:25:35,750
if we can just catch them
off guard... No, it's no good.

374
00:25:36,430 --> 00:25:40,130
I'm afraid that those ninja chasing us are
Orochimaru's henchmen.

375
00:25:40,630 --> 00:25:43,750
My guess is that they're all Junin-level.

376
00:25:44,290 --> 00:25:46,770
I really thought that would work.

377
00:25:46,870 --> 00:25:48,590
But I guess it won't.

378
00:25:48,591 --> 00:25:49,910
Wait, hold on.

379
00:25:50,010 --> 00:25:50,690
Why not?

380
00:25:50,990 --> 00:25:54,710
The level of an opponent doesn't have much
to do with an ambush, does it?

381
00:25:54,790 --> 00:25:56,390
You guys just don't get it.

382
00:25:56,430 --> 00:25:57,430
Let me explain.

383
00:25:57,870 --> 00:25:58,390
Yes.

384
00:25:58,650 --> 00:26:02,470
An ambush is a key battle tactic and can
be very beneficial.

385
00:26:02,850 --> 00:26:05,870
But for it to work, you have to meet two
conditions.

386
00:26:06,310 --> 00:26:06,990
Number one.

387
00:26:07,330 --> 00:26:12,190
The ninja on the run must be completely
quiet and must find the enemy first.

388
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:14,310
Number two.

389
00:26:14,510 --> 00:26:16,928
They have to be able
to catch the pursuers off

390
00:26:16,928 --> 00:26:18,570
guard at a location that
is important to them.

391
00:26:18,590 --> 00:26:20,353
This is an issue where
they can do a lot of damage

392
00:26:20,354 --> 00:26:23,150
quickly and then conceal
themselves again just as quickly.

393
00:26:23,470 --> 00:26:28,150
And it's only under those two conditions
that an ambush can truly be effective.

394
00:26:30,210 --> 00:26:33,250
Now, the first condition
won't be so hard since

395
00:26:33,251 --> 00:26:35,670
the Ninja Hound's
nose can find our enemy.

396
00:26:35,830 --> 00:26:39,830
And the second one also seems to be in our
favor since we know the geography of our

397
00:26:39,831 --> 00:26:41,690
village like we know the facts of our
hands.

398
00:26:41,930 --> 00:26:45,670
However, our pursuers have studied the
layout of this village.

399
00:26:45,671 --> 00:26:47,863
And I have to assume
that they've been put

400
00:26:47,864 --> 00:26:49,970
through simulated
practices for this mission.

401
00:26:50,410 --> 00:26:54,330
And on top of that, they're probably
masters of the pursuit jutsu.

402
00:26:55,710 --> 00:26:57,830
So they know all the cards we're holding?

403
00:26:58,330 --> 00:26:59,630
Well, I don't really know.

404
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:02,310
I suppose that an ambush could give us an
advantage.

405
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:04,510
But so many things are uncertain.

406
00:27:05,250 --> 00:27:07,860
Besides, our enemy is
a special unit that was

407
00:27:07,861 --> 00:27:10,210
specifically put together
just for this operation.

408
00:27:10,670 --> 00:27:12,130
And what are the four of us?

409
00:27:12,290 --> 00:27:13,290
A fool.

410
00:27:13,710 --> 00:27:15,650
A kunoichi with no particular purpose.

411
00:27:15,670 --> 00:27:16,670
A talent.

412
00:27:16,930 --> 00:27:18,130
A mutt.

413
00:27:19,294 --> 00:27:22,470
And me, the shirker who doesn't even want
to be here.

414
00:27:23,590 --> 00:27:26,148
Look, tactics are
about clearly grasping a

415
00:27:26,149 --> 00:27:28,950
tough situation and
formulating the best plan.

416
00:27:29,350 --> 00:27:32,370
And right now, only one plan makes sense.

417
00:27:33,070 --> 00:27:34,070
Just one.

418
00:27:34,710 --> 00:27:35,870
And that is?

419
00:27:36,350 --> 00:27:39,070
A diversion that only looks like it's an
ambush.

420
00:27:39,730 --> 00:27:44,730
So one of us is gonna stay behind and slow
them down.

421
00:27:46,510 --> 00:27:51,030
Of course, the one who acts as a decoy
will probably...

422
00:27:54,270 --> 00:27:55,270
die.

423
00:28:03,609 --> 00:28:05,130
So, who's going to do it?

424
00:28:05,850 --> 00:28:08,030
We need the dog to follow Sasuke.

425
00:28:09,469 --> 00:28:11,230
So that means...

426
00:28:18,024 --> 00:28:22,130
Alright, I guess that I'm... gonna
have to... I'm the only one who can do it.

427
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:23,750
Shikamaru!

428
00:28:23,751 --> 00:28:25,210
Why does it have to be you?

429
00:28:26,010 --> 00:28:28,450
It's better than all of us being wiped
out, right?

430
00:28:30,130 --> 00:28:34,430
Besides, I'm the only one of us who's got
a chance of pulling off this decoy act.

431
00:28:38,090 --> 00:28:40,110
And of surviving this attack.

432
00:28:42,710 --> 00:28:48,110
I mean, after all, shadow possession jutsu
was invented as a delay tactic.

433
00:28:49,650 --> 00:28:51,690
Anyway, I'll catch up with you later.

434
00:28:51,691 --> 00:28:54,590
Go on, get going.

435
00:28:58,490 --> 00:29:00,610
We're counting on you, Shikamaru!

436
00:29:07,450 --> 00:29:09,910
When did Shikamaru become this dedicated?

437
00:29:20,089 --> 00:29:21,370
His footprints are irregular.

438
00:29:21,371 --> 00:29:21,590
Regular.

439
00:29:22,174 --> 00:29:24,790
Anxiety is probably increasing his
fatigue.

440
00:29:30,370 --> 00:29:31,370
Oops.

441
00:29:32,590 --> 00:29:33,590
Sorry.

442
00:29:33,999 --> 00:29:36,650
I was supposed to be the guy who didn't
want to get involved.

443
00:29:38,710 --> 00:29:42,290
But I guess I'm not quite what you had
expected, am I?

444
00:29:44,150 --> 00:29:46,270
You're right about one thing, I'm tired.

445
00:29:46,490 --> 00:29:48,070
On everything else, you're wrong.

446
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,610
Like our footprints.

447
00:29:50,990 --> 00:29:53,230
This is what I used to make the paw
prints.

448
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:58,310
Why, he's just a kid.

449
00:29:58,530 --> 00:30:00,390
I can't believe we got caught by this.

450
00:30:02,050 --> 00:30:06,070
So this is the Leaf Shadow Paralysis jutsu
we've heard about, huh?

451
00:30:06,770 --> 00:30:10,130
Yeah, if you want to call it by that old
name.

452
00:30:10,890 --> 00:30:13,170
But I'm afraid you're behind the times.

453
00:30:13,390 --> 00:30:16,010
Now it's called Shadow Possession jutsu.

454
00:30:16,870 --> 00:30:17,870
Old man.

455
00:30:21,690 --> 00:30:22,330
One.

456
00:30:22,331 --> 00:30:23,331
Two.

457
00:30:23,630 --> 00:30:24,630
Three.

458
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:25,830
Four.

459
00:30:26,030 --> 00:30:26,670
Five.

460
00:30:26,890 --> 00:30:27,490
Six.

461
00:30:27,850 --> 00:30:28,490
Seven.

462
00:30:28,770 --> 00:30:29,410
Eight.

463
00:30:29,710 --> 00:30:30,710
Wait a minute.

464
00:30:30,870 --> 00:30:31,870
Eight?

465
00:30:32,810 --> 00:30:33,810
No, there's one more.

466
00:30:33,870 --> 00:30:35,810
That's nine ninja following us.

467
00:30:37,230 --> 00:30:38,230
Of course.

468
00:30:38,410 --> 00:30:41,570
The ninth one's role is to protect against
an ambush.

469
00:30:42,370 --> 00:30:44,724
That person stays a
distance behind the

470
00:30:44,725 --> 00:30:48,451
others, a reserve, in
case of an enemy attack.

471
00:30:49,404 --> 00:30:51,330
But I know what to do.

472
00:30:51,690 --> 00:30:55,590
This will draw out that ninth ninja and
reveal where he's hiding.

473
00:31:02,364 --> 00:31:03,930
There he is.

474
00:31:08,390 --> 00:31:09,390
Darn man.

475
00:31:09,570 --> 00:31:11,010
The shadow won't reach.

476
00:31:11,230 --> 00:31:14,850
I don't have enough stamina to use my
chakra to make it go that far.

477
00:31:15,904 --> 00:31:17,690
It looks like you're at your limit.

478
00:31:18,144 --> 00:31:21,450
This Shadow Possession jutsu of yours is
going to fail soon.

479
00:31:22,019 --> 00:31:23,310
So prepare yourself.

480
00:31:32,830 --> 00:31:38,210
All I really wanted was to be just an
average shinobi, making an average living.

481
00:31:39,150 --> 00:31:43,150
I'd marry a regular girl who's not super
pretty or super ugly.

482
00:31:43,730 --> 00:31:46,590
Have two kids, a girl and then a boy.

483
00:31:47,650 --> 00:31:51,250
Retire when my daughter got married and my
son became a successful ninja.

484
00:31:52,310 --> 00:31:55,950
And spend the rest of my days just playing
shogi or go.

485
00:31:56,150 --> 00:31:59,910
A nice, carefree, leisurely retirement.

486
00:32:01,149 --> 00:32:03,310
And then I'd die of old age before my
wife.

487
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:06,030
Yep, that's the life I wanted.

488
00:32:06,190 --> 00:32:08,310
And yet I ended up exerting myself.

489
00:32:08,650 --> 00:32:12,350
I had to go and get myself into this
sticky situation.

490
00:32:15,930 --> 00:32:19,010
Well, as you say, it appears I'm at my
limit.

491
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:31,850
Hey, come on out.

492
00:32:32,530 --> 00:32:35,530
And when you do, cut off his head.

493
00:32:47,310 --> 00:32:49,850
Well, I finally caught up with you guys.

494
00:32:50,170 --> 00:32:50,770
Asuma!

495
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,430
How did you...

496
00:33:10,860 --> 00:33:13,700
You did well, Shikamaru.

497
00:33:19,039 --> 00:33:20,800
Yeah, but it was way too much work.

498
00:33:22,609 --> 00:33:24,120
Stay here for now, Shikamaru.

499
00:33:24,340 --> 00:33:25,540
You've earned it.

500
00:33:34,449 --> 00:33:35,830
Well, Tamari, what's up?

501
00:33:36,670 --> 00:33:37,670
He's close.

502
00:33:38,669 --> 00:33:39,669
Very close.

503
00:33:39,840 --> 00:33:40,610
I knew it.

504
00:33:40,790 --> 00:33:41,790
What do we do?

505
00:33:43,579 --> 00:33:44,930
Leave everything to me.

506
00:34:10,199 --> 00:34:11,620
Well, that was close.

507
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:15,000
Whoa, what was that?

508
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:18,560
Tripwire traps.

509
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:22,500
They're certainly not making Sasuke's job
easy for him.

510
00:34:24,120 --> 00:34:27,860
Sasuke... do you think he might have
been... Oh, don't worry about Sasuke.

511
00:34:28,540 --> 00:34:30,639
It'd take a lot more than that to get rid
of him.

512
00:34:30,820 --> 00:34:31,820
He'll be fine.

513
00:34:35,179 --> 00:34:37,820
Now then, shall we begin this?

514
00:34:38,719 --> 00:34:41,829
First, let me restore these
dear old companions of

515
00:34:41,830 --> 00:34:44,540
yours to something more
like their former selves.

516
00:34:45,080 --> 00:34:49,900
And then, if you're ready,
Sarutobi-sensei...

517
00:35:32,510 --> 00:35:35,270
What the devil kind of jutsu is that?

518
00:35:36,080 --> 00:35:37,350
A forbidden one.

519
00:35:38,370 --> 00:35:42,490
It's a summoning jutsu called...
Reanimation.

520
00:35:45,470 --> 00:35:49,930
Normally, a summoning jutsu requires the
blood of the one casting it.

521
00:35:50,450 --> 00:35:55,330
But I've heard that this jutsu,
which summons the dead to the world of the

522
00:35:55,331 --> 00:35:58,478
living, demands the
sacrifice of a living

523
00:35:58,479 --> 00:36:01,870
body to be used as a
vessel for the dead soul.

524
00:36:01,871 --> 00:36:02,010
So...

525
00:36:02,011 --> 00:36:07,170
but then the living body is encased in a
shell of dust and earth that takes on the

526
00:36:07,171 --> 00:36:09,450
appearance of the dead spirit's earthly
form.

527
00:36:10,510 --> 00:36:14,028
Those spells he implanted
in their skulls, they sap the

528
00:36:14,029 --> 00:36:17,330
spirits of their will and
transform them into his puppets.

529
00:36:17,770 --> 00:36:19,230
Mere killing machines.

530
00:36:22,410 --> 00:36:24,030
Now they're complete.

531
00:36:25,290 --> 00:36:26,530
You demon.

532
00:36:27,130 --> 00:36:29,510
They look just the same as I remember.

533
00:36:30,415 --> 00:36:33,725
Have you ever felt the joy
and fulfillment of humiliating

534
00:36:33,726 --> 00:36:36,890
and destroying the one
you once called sensei?

535
00:36:38,120 --> 00:36:39,370
No, I suppose not.

536
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:43,290
Perhaps vicariously through me you'll get
a hint of what I mean.

537
00:36:44,270 --> 00:36:45,950
Just a taste before you die.

538
00:36:57,570 --> 00:36:58,590
Lord Hokage!

539
00:36:59,170 --> 00:37:01,230
Don't be deceived by their appearance!

540
00:37:01,490 --> 00:37:03,210
That is not the first Hokage!

541
00:37:03,370 --> 00:37:04,370
Nor the second!

542
00:37:04,450 --> 00:37:05,730
Whatever they may look like!

543
00:37:07,370 --> 00:37:08,610
I'm aware of that.

544
00:37:24,030 --> 00:37:26,202
Now I know you've been
playing games with me for a

545
00:37:26,202 --> 00:37:27,130
long time, so it's time for
you to play the first game!

546
00:37:27,131 --> 00:37:27,750
All right, let it begin.

547
00:37:28,050 --> 00:37:29,830
Fire style!

548
00:37:29,910 --> 00:37:31,190
Dragonflame bombs!

549
00:37:31,850 --> 00:37:33,190
Alchemy!

550
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:46,080
Fire style!

551
00:37:46,420 --> 00:37:48,420
Dragonflame bombs!

552
00:37:50,040 --> 00:37:51,440
Pfft!

553
00:37:59,540 --> 00:38:03,020
It's no less than I'd expect from a former
Hokage.

554
00:38:06,499 --> 00:38:09,220
Water style, water shockwave!

555
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,240
Earth style mudwall!

556
00:39:16,169 --> 00:39:18,850
As quick and strong as ever, I see.

557
00:39:29,310 --> 00:39:32,590
Fighting the two of you at once is quite a
challenge.

558
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:58,110
I can't wait to see
what you can do.

559
00:40:01,339 --> 00:40:04,410
I can't wait to see what you can do.

560
00:40:14,740 --> 00:40:18,340
The hidden jutsu of the first Hokage.

561
00:40:21,100 --> 00:40:23,280
Secret Earth Jutsu.

562
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,420
Secret Earth Jutsu.

563
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:25,880
Secret Earth Jutsu.

564
00:40:27,300 --> 00:40:29,560
Deep Forest Creation.

565
00:41:04,420 --> 00:41:05,020
It's over.

566
00:41:05,021 --> 00:41:07,020
Looks to me like this fight is over.

567
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:09,020
Say, Sensei?

568
00:41:15,740 --> 00:41:16,740
We're all here I see.

569
00:41:17,095 --> 00:41:18,095
Good.

570
00:41:19,270 --> 00:41:21,940
All right then, let's start evacuating the
building.

571
00:41:26,125 --> 00:41:28,610
That's it, no rushing, no panicking.

572
00:41:29,459 --> 00:41:30,210
Konohamaru!

573
00:41:30,211 --> 00:41:32,090
Amaru, is something wrong?

574
00:41:32,740 --> 00:41:34,830
You look like you have a tummy ache.

575
00:41:35,350 --> 00:41:36,370
Mm-mm.

576
00:41:37,715 --> 00:41:39,010
That's not it at all.

577
00:41:53,680 --> 00:41:55,040
Ninja Art!

578
00:41:56,129 --> 00:41:57,580
Summoning Jutsu!

579
00:41:58,530 --> 00:41:59,720
Monkey King Enma!

580
00:42:12,130 --> 00:42:13,130
Hmm.

581
00:42:13,290 --> 00:42:16,070
So a pesky newcomer has arrived.

582
00:42:19,630 --> 00:42:22,070
That old monkey Enma.

583
00:42:31,040 --> 00:42:32,400
It's you again.

584
00:42:33,220 --> 00:42:35,500
I should have known this would happen.

585
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:38,300
You fool, Sarutobi.

586
00:42:38,740 --> 00:42:41,460
You should have killed him when you had
the chance.

587
00:42:41,461 --> 00:42:43,440
Better late than never.

588
00:42:43,660 --> 00:42:44,280
Heh.

589
00:42:44,620 --> 00:42:46,260
It's too late now.

590
00:42:50,100 --> 00:42:50,860
Quickly!

591
00:42:50,861 --> 00:42:51,861
Enma!

592
00:42:52,160 --> 00:42:52,920
Adamantine!

593
00:42:53,100 --> 00:42:54,100
Nyoi!

594
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:56,300
Stop him now!

595
00:42:56,620 --> 00:42:58,120
Do not let him transform!

596
00:43:01,220 --> 00:43:02,800
All right, then.

597
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:03,880
Understood!

598
00:43:05,120 --> 00:43:06,120
Nyah!

599
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:10,260
Nyah!

600
00:43:12,880 --> 00:43:13,880
Transform!

601
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:22,580
At last!

602
00:43:29,540 --> 00:43:30,500
Unbelievable.

603
00:43:30,501 --> 00:43:33,260
I never dreamed I would live to see this.

604
00:43:33,700 --> 00:43:35,580
Okage-level combat!

605
00:43:35,581 --> 00:43:39,140
Good for you, old man.

606
00:43:39,480 --> 00:43:42,080
At least you've made this a little more
interesting.

607
00:43:53,640 --> 00:43:54,640
One of it.

608
00:43:54,740 --> 00:43:57,320
One swing of the Grass Longsword!

609
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:06,440
I'm ready, Enma!

610
00:44:06,840 --> 00:44:12,120
No matter how strong my body is...
The Grass Longsword will still hurt me!

611
00:44:15,880 --> 00:44:17,140
I knew that.

612
00:44:34,660 --> 00:44:35,660
C'mon!

613
00:44:39,540 --> 00:44:40,500
I'll go get you.

614
00:44:40,501 --> 00:44:41,420
I'll make you pay for this!

615
00:44:41,421 --> 00:44:41,440
I'm going to use this thing for a while.

616
00:44:41,441 --> 00:44:41,640
I have to do this!

617
00:44:41,641 --> 00:44:41,680
C'mon Enma!

618
00:44:41,681 --> 00:44:42,020
Y-you'll die, too!

619
00:44:42,021 --> 00:44:43,021
Huh!

620
00:44:43,180 --> 00:44:43,980
I'd rather die, huh?

621
00:44:43,981 --> 00:44:44,981
Quite the opposite.

622
00:44:46,320 --> 00:44:47,320
Okay then.

623
00:45:14,580 --> 00:45:16,360
That was foolish.

624
00:45:17,235 --> 00:45:20,980
Trying to fight the three of us without
using your shadow clone, Jutsu.

625
00:45:22,010 --> 00:45:24,140
Oh, are you all right, Sensei?

626
00:45:25,549 --> 00:45:27,520
Don't tell me you're through already.

627
00:45:29,300 --> 00:45:33,420
You, the great sage who has mastered all
the Jutsu of the Leaf Village,

628
00:45:33,620 --> 00:45:36,440
the legendary professor and warrior...

629
00:45:37,180 --> 00:45:39,140
Oh, I'm so disappointed.

630
00:45:43,600 --> 00:45:44,800
Lord Hokage!

631
00:45:46,830 --> 00:45:47,830
Save your breath.

632
00:45:48,140 --> 00:45:49,920
He can't help you now.

633
00:45:56,710 --> 00:45:58,310
Orochimaru, you're a fool!

634
00:46:06,350 --> 00:46:07,350
It's over.

635
00:46:07,570 --> 00:46:10,470
I'm going to snap you like a twig.

636
00:46:10,590 --> 00:46:12,950
It should have been done years ago.

637
00:46:29,610 --> 00:46:30,850
I think you're about to die.

638
00:46:32,450 --> 00:46:33,030
What?

639
00:46:33,031 --> 00:46:33,650
You're a man who wants to kill!

640
00:46:33,651 --> 00:46:41,170
You're not dead, you're prepared to die.

641
00:46:42,330 --> 00:46:43,330
What did you do to me?

642
00:47:10,200 --> 00:47:11,200
You're a good man.

643
00:47:11,250 --> 00:47:16,370
Come on then.

644
00:47:16,371 --> 00:47:17,371
Orochimaru's will.

645
00:47:18,690 --> 00:47:19,730
So be it.

646
00:47:20,130 --> 00:47:21,630
I have only one weapon left.

647
00:47:21,710 --> 00:47:24,070
The fourth Hokage's jutsu.

648
00:47:28,530 --> 00:47:29,640
First Lord Hokage.

649
00:47:29,820 --> 00:47:31,660
Second Lord Hokage.

650
00:47:32,020 --> 00:47:35,540
Forgive me for using it, but I must.

651
00:47:37,615 --> 00:47:38,900
What is it, sensei?

652
00:47:38,920 --> 00:47:40,540
You look a little out of breath.

653
00:47:41,455 --> 00:47:42,455
Long day.

654
00:47:44,145 --> 00:47:45,145
You poor thing.

655
00:47:45,990 --> 00:47:49,440
All you really want is to take a long,
quiet nap, isn't it?

656
00:47:54,225 --> 00:47:55,980
Why are you laughing?

657
00:47:58,090 --> 00:47:59,260
Should I be weeping?

658
00:48:00,730 --> 00:48:03,527
It's sad to see how
old you've grown, you

659
00:48:03,528 --> 00:48:07,480
who were once hailed
as the supreme shinobi.

660
00:48:09,920 --> 00:48:10,920
What?

661
00:48:11,100 --> 00:48:12,140
What the hell?

662
00:48:12,300 --> 00:48:13,300
What is going on?

663
00:48:15,800 --> 00:48:18,360
Who... or what is that?

664
00:48:19,520 --> 00:48:20,740
What is this?

665
00:48:20,960 --> 00:48:22,600
Who the devil are you?

666
00:48:23,160 --> 00:48:25,400
You have lost it, old man.

667
00:48:25,760 --> 00:48:27,580
Don't you recognize me?

668
00:48:27,700 --> 00:48:30,040
It's me, Orochimaru.

669
00:48:32,100 --> 00:48:33,360
It can't be.

670
00:48:33,960 --> 00:48:37,100
Then you've mastered even that forbidden
jutsu?

671
00:48:42,300 --> 00:48:46,200
It's been ten years of hard work since I
left the village.

672
00:48:47,060 --> 00:48:48,800
You're no longer human.

673
00:48:49,100 --> 00:48:50,400
You're a demon!

674
00:49:00,260 --> 00:49:02,560
Yes, he did it after all.

675
00:49:03,140 --> 00:49:06,660
This is why I could never choose you to be
the fourth Hokage.

676
00:49:07,080 --> 00:49:09,520
Your mind and soul are twisted.

677
00:49:23,360 --> 00:49:23,920
You're no longer human.

678
00:49:23,920 --> 00:49:23,920
Your mind and soul are twisted.

679
00:49:23,921 --> 00:49:26,100
So I've finally been found out,
eh?

680
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:30,860
Oh, such a pity.

681
00:49:31,680 --> 00:49:32,680
Orochimaru!

682
00:49:33,000 --> 00:49:35,380
Explain yourself, what is the meaning of
this?

683
00:49:35,580 --> 00:49:39,920
And after I set all those booby traps to
give me plenty of warning...

684
00:49:39,921 --> 00:49:42,700
I wasn't expecting you.

685
00:49:43,220 --> 00:49:46,260
I should have known you could get past
anything.

686
00:49:46,720 --> 00:49:49,340
A steady flow of people have gone missing
from the village.

687
00:49:49,341 --> 00:49:52,720
Geni, Chunin, even Anbu Black Ops.

688
00:49:52,880 --> 00:49:54,520
Many of them were last seen with you.

689
00:49:54,700 --> 00:49:56,780
And you've been acting rather strangely.

690
00:49:58,000 --> 00:50:00,120
You, a superior shinobi.

691
00:50:00,280 --> 00:50:01,920
How could you have done such a thing?

692
00:50:03,960 --> 00:50:06,020
Now I'll have to kill you as well.

693
00:50:07,380 --> 00:50:08,900
So you admit it.

694
00:50:09,300 --> 00:50:11,700
Then it is all your doing, Orochimaru.

695
00:50:12,160 --> 00:50:12,920
But why?

696
00:50:13,160 --> 00:50:15,300
What exactly are you up to in here?

697
00:50:15,301 --> 00:50:16,520
Oh, well.

698
00:50:17,140 --> 00:50:21,820
Since you've caught me red-handed, there's
no point in pretending now, is there?

699
00:50:22,560 --> 00:50:23,600
It's research.

700
00:50:24,260 --> 00:50:26,120
I'm developing jutsu.

701
00:50:26,440 --> 00:50:29,480
It's forbidden jutsu you're after,
isn't it?

702
00:50:31,000 --> 00:50:32,840
Just what is it you want?

703
00:50:33,800 --> 00:50:36,380
I want to know every jutsu in the world.

704
00:50:36,620 --> 00:50:39,520
And even those jutsu yet to be discovered.

705
00:50:40,340 --> 00:50:43,180
I'm like the one who first took blue and
yellow.

706
00:50:43,960 --> 00:50:47,280
Consciously mixed them together and
created a new color, green.

707
00:50:48,360 --> 00:50:51,580
Only in my case, the color blue represents
chakra.

708
00:50:52,120 --> 00:50:54,380
The color yellow, a hand sign.

709
00:50:54,740 --> 00:50:56,960
And the green, a new jutsu.

710
00:50:57,280 --> 00:51:00,760
And just as there are
countless shades of color in the

711
00:51:00,761 --> 00:51:04,340
world, there must be an
almost limitless number of jutsu.

712
00:51:04,900 --> 00:51:06,180
To find them.

713
00:51:06,300 --> 00:51:10,160
To unlock the truth long hidden from
mortal eyes.

714
00:51:10,480 --> 00:51:11,820
That takes years.

715
00:51:12,480 --> 00:51:13,680
Endless experimentation.

716
00:51:15,300 --> 00:51:20,180
Ultimately, the truth reveals itself only
to one who proves himself worthy.

717
00:51:20,480 --> 00:51:23,640
One who is willing to sacrifice years of
his life.

718
00:51:24,020 --> 00:51:28,660
But alas, I've found there are not enough
years in even the longest life.

719
00:51:28,900 --> 00:51:31,300
This mortal existence is too fleeting.

720
00:51:32,760 --> 00:51:39,081
Yes, even if I were named Hokage, one day I
would die and that would be the end of it.

721
00:51:39,480 --> 00:51:40,080
Orochimaru.

722
00:51:40,081 --> 00:51:43,800
What sort of forbidden jutsu have you been
seeking here?

723
00:51:44,060 --> 00:51:46,420
Oh, I think you've already guessed.

724
00:51:50,280 --> 00:51:52,180
Eternal youth and immortality.

725
00:52:02,480 --> 00:52:04,580
The immortality jutsu.

726
00:52:04,660 --> 00:52:08,440
A technique for eternally recycling one's
spirit on Earth.

727
00:52:08,441 --> 00:52:12,180
In a way, it's a kind of revival jutsu.

728
00:52:12,420 --> 00:52:13,980
You find a body.

729
00:52:14,100 --> 00:52:15,340
A young body.

730
00:52:15,780 --> 00:52:19,060
Pour your spirit into it and make it your
own.

731
00:52:22,560 --> 00:52:26,200
I was using my old familiar form until
now.

732
00:52:26,500 --> 00:52:30,960
Because I wanted our reunion to be a nice
nostalgic one, Sensei.

733
00:52:32,480 --> 00:52:36,160
Growing old is a sad, empty thing.

734
00:52:36,161 --> 00:52:39,880
I only have to look at you to be reminded
of that.

735
00:52:41,380 --> 00:52:46,940
You will die here, old man, while I move
on to another stronger body.

736
00:52:47,220 --> 00:52:50,606
But first, I really must
thank you, and all the

737
00:52:50,607 --> 00:52:55,040
Leaf Village, for preparing
my next body so well.

738
00:52:56,680 --> 00:52:58,280
Now I understand.

739
00:52:58,640 --> 00:53:00,460
It's Sasuke Uchiha!

740
00:53:04,340 --> 00:53:05,340
Exactly.

741
00:53:05,580 --> 00:53:07,020
You guessed it.

742
00:53:07,340 --> 00:53:09,420
It's Sasuke I want.

743
00:53:10,240 --> 00:53:15,860
So you've mastered a jutsu that preserves
your soul forever in the bodies of others.

744
00:53:16,100 --> 00:53:18,400
How many bodies has it been already?

745
00:53:18,700 --> 00:53:19,980
How many faces?

746
00:53:21,100 --> 00:53:22,560
Two or three, perhaps.

747
00:53:23,000 --> 00:53:27,100
But I'll wait for Sasuke until he's
ripened a bit.

748
00:53:27,300 --> 00:53:31,121
And then, when he's been raised
and trained... I'll bring him to my liking.

749
00:53:32,840 --> 00:53:36,080
Tell me, which face would you prefer me to
wear?

750
00:53:37,740 --> 00:53:42,740
Perhaps it would be easier for you to look
on a familiar face as you die,

751
00:53:43,000 --> 00:53:45,200
cursing your brief wasted life.

752
00:53:47,640 --> 00:53:48,840
You monster!

753
00:54:01,300 --> 00:54:02,440
Lord Hokage!

754
00:54:07,820 --> 00:54:11,120
You really shouldn't lower your guard,
sensei.

755
00:54:11,320 --> 00:54:12,560
That's your problem.

756
00:54:12,660 --> 00:54:13,860
You've always been naive.

757
00:54:20,980 --> 00:54:22,320
What's wrong with you?

758
00:54:22,680 --> 00:54:24,320
This isn't like you.

759
00:54:24,560 --> 00:54:25,560
I'm sorry.

760
00:54:34,220 --> 00:54:36,100
What are you planning to do?

761
00:54:36,860 --> 00:54:38,780
Kill me, sensei?

762
00:54:41,140 --> 00:54:43,220
Ninja Arch summoning jutsu!

763
00:54:47,260 --> 00:54:50,520
But can you go through with it,
I wonder?

764
00:54:52,380 --> 00:54:53,660
Sarutobi sensei?

765
00:54:53,880 --> 00:54:54,880
Hm?

766
00:55:11,310 --> 00:55:12,800
Kill him, Sarutobi!

767
00:55:13,040 --> 00:55:14,280
Now is your chance!

768
00:55:34,840 --> 00:55:36,720
Sarutobi... why?

769
00:55:38,580 --> 00:55:40,140
I couldn't do it.

770
00:55:42,580 --> 00:55:46,980
Now I'll correct my mistake and bury you
once and for all!

771
00:55:47,580 --> 00:55:49,680
It's time to end this!

772
00:55:52,340 --> 00:55:55,300
Hm... I'm afraid it's too late now!

773
00:55:58,020 --> 00:55:59,900
Shadow clone jutsu!

774
00:56:01,740 --> 00:56:03,680
No... shadow clones?

775
00:56:03,860 --> 00:56:06,620
He's going to exhaust what little chakra
he has left!

776
00:56:08,480 --> 00:56:11,180
You'll only shorten your life,
sensei.

777
00:56:11,260 --> 00:56:14,380
I think your impatience is getting the
better of you.

778
00:56:14,960 --> 00:56:17,620
Could it be... is he...

779
00:56:19,300 --> 00:56:23,540
Mie Hitsuchi U Ino Ne Toriuma Mi!

780
00:56:26,380 --> 00:56:30,000
Yes... that sequence of hand signs... I
knew it!

781
00:56:44,740 --> 00:56:47,800
So... it's just as the poor Hokage said.

782
00:56:47,801 --> 00:56:51,720
This is the Reaper, the
face of death, invisible

783
00:56:51,721 --> 00:56:55,181
to all, but the one
who casts the jutsu!

784
00:56:55,220 --> 00:56:57,520
Whatever you're planning, it's too late.

785
00:56:58,000 --> 00:56:59,620
It's over, I've won.

786
00:57:00,020 --> 00:57:01,920
The Leaf Village will fall.

787
00:57:02,380 --> 00:57:05,480
You're forgetting that the Leaf Village is
my home.

788
00:57:05,660 --> 00:57:08,980
And as Hokage, I am entrusted with my
home's protection.

789
00:57:09,300 --> 00:57:11,740
I am head of the household, the central
pillar.

790
00:57:12,020 --> 00:57:15,380
He who would destroy my home must first
destroy me.

791
00:57:15,381 --> 00:57:18,260
And I warn you, it will not be easy!

792
00:57:19,340 --> 00:57:20,520
Yen Jutsu!

793
00:57:20,580 --> 00:57:22,380
Infinite Darkness Jutsu!

794
00:57:30,080 --> 00:57:31,080
What nonsense.

795
00:57:31,420 --> 00:57:35,403
In the grand scheme of time,
you're just a trivial footnote in

796
00:57:35,404 --> 00:57:38,800
the brief history of a cluster
of huts called the Leaf Village.

797
00:57:44,640 --> 00:57:46,687
In the grand scheme of time,
you're just a trivial footnote in

798
00:57:46,687 --> 00:57:47,140
the brief history of a cluster
of huts called the Leaf Village.

799
00:57:47,141 --> 00:57:51,920
In time, the Hokage's stone faces will
crumble and be worn down to nothing.

800
00:57:53,000 --> 00:57:57,180
You've never understood that it's far more
than a mere cluster of huts.

801
00:58:01,570 --> 00:58:10,170
It is a place where every year, shinobi
are born, raised, growled, fight, and die.

802
00:58:10,250 --> 00:58:11,650
To protect their home.

803
00:58:36,930 --> 00:58:39,410
These people are precious to me.

804
00:58:40,050 --> 00:58:41,530
We share a home.

805
00:58:42,190 --> 00:58:43,730
We share a life.

806
00:58:43,990 --> 00:58:47,230
And though we may not share ties of
blood...

807
00:58:48,310 --> 00:58:50,390
They are precious to me.

808
00:58:50,690 --> 00:58:52,430
They are my family.

809
00:58:59,050 --> 00:58:59,970
They are my friends.

810
00:58:59,971 --> 00:59:01,330
The pillar of your village.

811
00:59:01,630 --> 00:59:04,390
A pillar full of termites and rot.

812
00:59:04,630 --> 00:59:06,690
I don't have to knock you down.

813
00:59:06,810 --> 00:59:08,350
You're already falling.

814
00:59:09,770 --> 00:59:12,750
And if I do fall, you still will fail.

815
00:59:12,930 --> 00:59:15,070
I am only one of a long line.

816
00:59:15,610 --> 00:59:17,730
I carry this title in trust.

817
00:59:17,870 --> 00:59:21,610
For those Hokage who came before and those
who will come after.

818
00:59:21,611 --> 00:59:23,950
I am the third Hokage.

819
00:59:24,830 --> 00:59:27,510
You can't stop it by destroying me.

820
00:59:28,070 --> 00:59:31,270
A new and stronger Hokage will take my
place.

821
00:59:31,390 --> 00:59:34,870
Becoming the pillar, roof, and walls that
defend the village.

822
00:59:37,550 --> 00:59:38,830
Now Orochimaru.

823
00:59:40,190 --> 00:59:41,350
Get ready.

824
00:59:41,670 --> 00:59:45,830
For I'm about to perform a jutsu that even
you haven't seen before.

825
00:59:47,610 --> 00:59:48,610
Behold.

826
00:59:48,650 --> 00:59:50,010
Sealing jutsu.

827
00:59:50,011 --> 00:59:51,350
Reaper Death Seal.

828
00:59:58,180 --> 00:59:59,180
I've got to hurry.

829
00:59:59,510 --> 01:00:01,810
This darkness is dangerous.

830
01:00:04,070 --> 01:00:05,070
Well.

831
01:00:05,170 --> 01:00:07,870
Must I make you show it to me?

832
01:00:08,350 --> 01:00:09,350
Huh?

833
01:00:16,100 --> 01:00:19,350
Are you going to show me this jutsu or
not?

834
01:00:19,930 --> 01:00:20,630
Hurry.

835
01:00:20,950 --> 01:00:21,950
Hurry.

836
01:00:58,520 --> 01:00:59,920
Let's go.

837
01:01:03,170 --> 01:01:06,470
Finally it's done and not a minute too
soon.

838
01:01:06,710 --> 01:01:07,930
Aw, what's wrong?

839
01:01:08,250 --> 01:01:10,430
You're reeling from fatigue already.

840
01:01:14,430 --> 01:01:18,030
Now all that's left is to catch hold of
him.

841
01:01:21,270 --> 01:01:22,550
I have you.

842
01:01:29,070 --> 01:01:31,370
I won't let go!

843
01:01:31,730 --> 01:01:33,410
I summon thee!

844
01:01:56,250 --> 01:01:57,330
The

845
01:02:13,290 --> 01:02:14,430
darkness vanished.

846
01:02:14,790 --> 01:02:16,970
What is this, Jutsu?

847
01:02:17,210 --> 01:02:19,050
Forgive us, Sarutobi.

848
01:02:21,890 --> 01:02:24,970
We made your life difficult.

849
01:02:27,680 --> 01:02:33,530
And forgive me, First Lord Hokage,
Second Lord Hokage.

850
01:02:36,830 --> 01:02:38,870
Now, seal!

851
01:03:02,420 --> 01:03:04,140
You sacrificed your people.

852
01:03:05,670 --> 01:03:09,520
You were meant to guide them, not toy with
them as if they were dolls.

853
01:03:10,440 --> 01:03:11,900
Are you finished, Sensei?

854
01:03:12,150 --> 01:03:14,120
Have we had enough of this nonsense yet?

855
01:03:17,335 --> 01:03:18,560
Enma, come!

856
01:03:25,190 --> 01:03:26,790
I'm... I'm... got him!

857
01:03:28,790 --> 01:03:34,790
I'm... got him!

858
01:03:35,610 --> 01:03:36,850
Striking Shadow Snake!

859
01:03:39,270 --> 01:03:40,270
Damn you!

860
01:03:43,330 --> 01:03:44,810
Now to finish it!

861
01:03:57,980 --> 01:03:59,700
What is this I feel?

862
01:04:01,420 --> 01:04:02,920
This is bad!

863
01:04:15,040 --> 01:04:16,400
Now die!

864
01:04:24,380 --> 01:04:30,660
Aren't you going to use the power?

865
01:04:30,780 --> 01:04:31,800
This isn't over!

866
01:04:31,801 --> 01:04:32,801
I'm...

867
01:04:35,440 --> 01:04:38,481
I'm... I'm...
I'm... I'm... Fuck!

868
01:04:39,280 --> 01:04:40,820
I... Oh, man.

869
01:04:41,180 --> 01:04:42,220
It's over!

870
01:04:42,221 --> 01:04:43,221
You'll dodge it!

871
01:04:46,800 --> 01:04:49,400
There was no need to dodge the blade.

872
01:04:50,100 --> 01:04:51,760
My fate is sealed.

873
01:04:53,100 --> 01:04:57,940
It is a jutsu of the great hero who once
saved this village.

874
01:04:58,480 --> 01:05:01,760
Once the seal is complete, I will die.

875
01:05:02,000 --> 01:05:05,940
But I will die knowing that I've taken you
with me!

876
01:05:05,941 --> 01:05:12,340
So then... this is the jutsu that sealed
the nine-tailed fox spirit!

877
01:05:13,920 --> 01:05:20,260
Inch by inch, your soul will be dragged
out of you... and sealed forever!

878
01:05:21,820 --> 01:05:24,880
My body... I can't make it move!

879
01:05:29,000 --> 01:05:32,540
Another moment or two and you'll be able
to see it.

880
01:05:32,860 --> 01:05:34,880
It's nearly halfway out.

881
01:05:34,881 --> 01:05:40,700
You'll be able to bid a last farewell to
your soul... but not to your suffering.

882
01:05:41,140 --> 01:05:47,160
For those souls that are sealed by this
jutsu are doomed to suffer for eternity in

883
01:05:47,161 --> 01:05:50,220
the belly of the reaper, never to rest in
peace.

884
01:05:50,700 --> 01:05:56,280
There, the souls of the sealed and the
sealer are forever intertwined,

885
01:05:56,340 --> 01:06:02,020
bound together by hatred, locked in
ceaseless combat till the end of time.

886
01:06:09,260 --> 01:06:10,020
But I will die.

887
01:06:10,021 --> 01:06:11,021
What is that?

888
01:06:14,980 --> 01:06:18,140
That thing... is the reaper!

889
01:06:18,620 --> 01:06:20,020
You old fool!

890
01:06:20,460 --> 01:06:24,620
Do you really think I'll just stand here
like a frightened child and do nothing?!

891
01:06:36,480 --> 01:06:42,200
You, the old fool... just let him die!

892
01:06:42,201 --> 01:06:43,260
Go along, Sensei!

893
01:06:43,360 --> 01:06:44,580
Hurry up and die!

894
01:06:45,300 --> 01:06:46,300
No...

895
01:07:00,360 --> 01:07:02,600
Hayate... I will avenge your death.

896
01:07:03,295 --> 01:07:04,460
I promise!

897
01:07:09,300 --> 01:07:10,300
That's the signal.

898
01:07:10,460 --> 01:07:10,940
Let's go.

899
01:07:10,941 --> 01:07:11,941
Right.

900
01:07:23,780 --> 01:07:25,780
We have to hold them off somehow.

901
01:07:26,180 --> 01:07:27,180
Where's our backup?

902
01:07:32,000 --> 01:07:33,660
Ninja aren't summoning!

903
01:07:33,661 --> 01:07:35,620
Bring down the house jutsu!

904
01:07:48,060 --> 01:07:50,480
Long time no see, Ibiki.

905
01:07:51,480 --> 01:07:54,020
My, my, what have they been feeding you?

906
01:07:54,260 --> 01:07:57,080
You used to be such a little squirt.

907
01:07:57,940 --> 01:07:59,140
Master Jiraiya.

908
01:07:59,680 --> 01:08:00,280
Jiraiya?

909
01:08:00,380 --> 01:08:01,620
One of the Sanin?

910
01:08:02,200 --> 01:08:03,980
All right, you baby chicks.

911
01:08:04,220 --> 01:08:06,540
Open wide those beady little eyes of
yours.

912
01:08:06,600 --> 01:08:07,600
Watch closely.

913
01:08:12,380 --> 01:08:16,380
When it comes to dealing with strange
otherworldly freaks and monsters,

914
01:08:16,580 --> 01:08:19,680
no one's better than a strange hermit
ninja.

915
01:08:21,660 --> 01:08:24,439
Thank goodness that Jiraiya's here!

916
01:08:27,660 --> 01:08:32,180
Now, unless you want to make this frog
really mad, you'll never bother us again!

917
01:08:33,660 --> 01:08:38,080
So that pain in the neck Orochimaru has
finally started.

918
01:08:40,859 --> 01:08:42,000
Where's Hokage?

919
01:08:43,279 --> 01:08:44,319
The battle arena.

920
01:08:46,180 --> 01:08:47,220
I see.

921
01:08:49,640 --> 01:08:51,439
Don't die on us, old man.

922
01:08:54,200 --> 01:08:56,060
All right now, stay together!

923
01:09:01,160 --> 01:09:02,740
Now everyone keep quiet!

924
01:09:04,600 --> 01:09:05,600
Oh, Komohamaru!

925
01:09:07,279 --> 01:09:09,880
It's not gonna collapse on top of us,
is it?

926
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:12,040
No way, don't worry, we'll be fine.

927
01:09:12,420 --> 01:09:15,040
Even though this tunnel under the mountain
is really old.

928
01:09:15,979 --> 01:09:17,220
It's strong, too.

929
01:09:17,399 --> 01:09:19,359
They knew how to build things back then.

930
01:09:19,800 --> 01:09:22,859
My grandpa told me that, and my grandpa's
always right.

931
01:09:26,460 --> 01:09:27,460
That's right.

932
01:09:27,800 --> 01:09:30,300
So no worries, we're gonna be just fine.

933
01:09:39,340 --> 01:09:40,899
What are all these other smells?

934
01:09:41,180 --> 01:09:43,920
A bunch of them, all converging on the
same spot.

935
01:09:45,160 --> 01:09:47,043
Smells like we're not
the only ones tracking

936
01:09:47,044 --> 01:09:49,641
Sasuke, there's
something else out there!

937
01:09:49,700 --> 01:09:50,180
Really?

938
01:09:50,260 --> 01:09:50,560
Where?

939
01:09:50,561 --> 01:09:51,880
Who is it?

940
01:09:51,920 --> 01:09:52,920
Friend or foe?

941
01:09:53,500 --> 01:09:55,680
I don't know, but...

942
01:09:56,400 --> 01:09:57,400
But what?

943
01:09:59,200 --> 01:10:00,560
It isn't human.

944
01:10:13,670 --> 01:10:16,210
Tamari, you take Gaara and go on ahead.

945
01:10:16,630 --> 01:10:17,630
Huh?

946
01:10:18,020 --> 01:10:19,570
You're all worn out, look at yourself.

947
01:10:21,200 --> 01:10:23,050
Go on, you'll only get in my way.

948
01:10:23,051 --> 01:10:24,051
Wait a second!

949
01:10:24,380 --> 01:10:25,380
Get moving!

950
01:10:26,930 --> 01:10:27,990
All right.

951
01:10:30,270 --> 01:10:31,270
Okay, Uchiha.

952
01:10:31,990 --> 01:10:34,170
Time you picked on someone your own size.

953
01:10:37,030 --> 01:10:38,730
Whatever you say.

954
01:10:39,210 --> 01:10:40,210
Hold on!

955
01:10:40,830 --> 01:10:43,310
I've got dibs on him first, Sasuke.

956
01:10:47,440 --> 01:10:48,870
What do you want?

957
01:10:50,810 --> 01:10:51,810
She knows.

958
01:10:51,970 --> 01:10:52,530
She knows?

959
01:10:52,531 --> 01:10:53,531
How did you find us?

960
01:10:55,990 --> 01:10:58,630
I planted a beetle on you as you left the
arena.

961
01:10:59,090 --> 01:11:00,570
A female beetle.

962
01:11:02,830 --> 01:11:06,337
She gives off a very
faint scent, nothing you

963
01:11:06,338 --> 01:11:09,451
could detect, but the
male of this species can.

964
01:11:10,170 --> 01:11:14,690
He has a very strong sense of smell and
he'd follow her anywhere.

965
01:11:14,691 --> 01:11:15,691
Anywhere.

966
01:11:20,410 --> 01:11:24,210
Sasuke Uchiha, it's Gaara you're really
after.

967
01:11:24,430 --> 01:11:28,090
That is, because your match against him
was left unfinished.

968
01:11:30,370 --> 01:11:34,930
Well, I have similar unfinished business
with Konkoro.

969
01:11:35,360 --> 01:11:37,890
Because our match never even started.

970
01:11:39,830 --> 01:11:42,530
Well, alright then, if you're sure you're
okay.

971
01:11:43,270 --> 01:11:47,450
Don't worry, give me ten minutes and I'll
come after you to see if you're okay.

972
01:11:49,290 --> 01:11:52,530
Don't waste your time, by then my work
will be done too.

973
01:12:03,330 --> 01:12:07,090
You clueless fools, you don't know what
you're in for.

974
01:12:08,130 --> 01:12:12,450
Imagine, something more monstrous than
your worst nightmare.

975
01:12:12,530 --> 01:12:14,090
Only it's real.

976
01:12:16,290 --> 01:12:19,030
Hmm, I'm having a little trouble picturing
it.

977
01:12:19,390 --> 01:12:21,430
Why don't you go ahead and show me?

978
01:12:23,410 --> 01:12:25,070
Oh, it's not me.

979
01:12:26,290 --> 01:12:30,490
If you're ever unlucky enough to catch up
with Gaara, that's when you'll see it.

980
01:12:31,290 --> 01:12:33,850
But first, of course, you'll have to beat
me.

981
01:13:10,990 --> 01:13:14,410
I am a member of the Hidden Leaf Village's
Aburame Clan.

982
01:13:15,150 --> 01:13:19,550
When we fight, no matter how puny our
opponent is, we don't mock them.

983
01:13:19,850 --> 01:13:21,910
We face them with full strength.

984
01:13:23,550 --> 01:13:24,590
Bring him on.

985
01:13:42,930 --> 01:13:44,710
Tamari, put me down.

986
01:13:44,711 --> 01:13:46,550
You sure you're strong enough,
Gaara?

987
01:13:51,270 --> 01:13:52,270
Gaara!

988
01:13:57,990 --> 01:14:01,290
There's no telling how long Kankuro can
delay Uchiha.

989
01:14:02,350 --> 01:14:04,050
Every second counts.

990
01:14:05,450 --> 01:14:08,170
If we don't keep moving, the whole plan
will fail.

991
01:14:09,870 --> 01:14:11,950
Leave me alone, Tamari.

992
01:14:12,550 --> 01:14:13,430
Go away.

993
01:14:13,431 --> 01:14:15,630
You're nothing but a nuisance.

994
01:14:17,050 --> 01:14:18,570
I don't need you.

995
01:14:24,005 --> 01:14:25,130
I don't need you.

996
01:14:25,131 --> 01:14:29,430
I'm sorry.

997
01:14:55,100 --> 01:14:55,500
I don't see the point in continuing
fighting.

998
01:14:55,520 --> 01:14:56,520
Take care of yourself.

999
01:14:56,680 --> 01:14:57,440
I'll be there for you.

1000
01:14:57,441 --> 01:14:58,441
Are you all right?

1001
01:15:02,095 --> 01:15:03,360
Poison on the blade.

1002
01:15:14,380 --> 01:15:15,500
Sasuke Uchiha!

1003
01:15:16,100 --> 01:15:18,160
Did he get past Konkuru already?

1004
01:15:19,240 --> 01:15:21,140
No, it was too quick.

1005
01:15:21,780 --> 01:15:23,880
Someone else must have shown up.

1006
01:15:24,120 --> 01:15:27,860
I have no idea what scheme you Sand
Village clowns have got going,

1007
01:15:28,380 --> 01:15:30,520
but I'll stop it, no matter what it is!

1008
01:15:33,220 --> 01:15:34,220
Besides...

1009
01:15:39,730 --> 01:15:42,850
I'm dying to see what you really are.

1010
01:15:44,530 --> 01:15:47,490
Gaara, no!

1011
01:15:52,150 --> 01:15:53,250
Oh no!

1012
01:15:53,730 --> 01:15:54,810
It's happening!

1013
01:15:55,090 --> 01:15:57,630
Any second he's going to let that thing
out!

1014
01:15:57,990 --> 01:15:59,430
No, not now!

1015
01:15:59,630 --> 01:16:00,630
Not now!

1016
01:16:00,870 --> 01:16:01,990
No, Gaara!

1017
01:16:02,190 --> 01:16:03,490
Remember our mission!

1018
01:16:03,870 --> 01:16:05,590
We're so alike, Uchiha.

1019
01:16:05,870 --> 01:16:07,950
I don't have friends as you have.

1020
01:16:08,130 --> 01:16:08,670
No!

1021
01:16:08,671 --> 01:16:10,310
But they're not what makes you strong.

1022
01:16:10,570 --> 01:16:12,590
It's your purpose that does it.

1023
01:16:12,630 --> 01:16:14,270
In that way, we're alike.

1024
01:16:16,130 --> 01:16:17,130
You...

1025
01:16:30,790 --> 01:16:33,010
You are my prey!

1026
01:16:33,990 --> 01:16:35,490
My prey!

1027
01:16:35,491 --> 01:16:36,290
My prey!

1028
01:16:36,291 --> 01:16:40,210
My prey!

1029
01:16:45,630 --> 01:16:48,490
It was tournament.

1030
01:16:54,020 --> 01:16:56,360
You're making this too easy.

1031
01:17:01,570 --> 01:17:02,600
That did it!

1032
01:17:08,940 --> 01:17:10,740
Those damn bugs again!

1033
01:17:13,840 --> 01:17:17,380
You made a clone out of bugs, then snuck
up behind me.

1034
01:17:17,660 --> 01:17:18,700
Not too bad.

1035
01:17:19,040 --> 01:17:20,040
It was simple, really.

1036
01:17:20,340 --> 01:17:23,560
I can tell from your jutsu that your
strength is long-range attacks,

1037
01:17:23,700 --> 01:17:24,700
not close combat.

1038
01:17:25,060 --> 01:17:28,680
Thanks for the dissertation, but I'm just
getting started here.

1039
01:17:29,140 --> 01:17:29,820
Don't worry.

1040
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:32,422
If you really want to see
how deadly my ninjutsu

1041
01:17:32,423 --> 01:17:35,501
can be, then you're
in for a real treat.

1042
01:17:35,680 --> 01:17:38,100
You haven't seen half of what Crow can do.

1043
01:17:38,260 --> 01:17:40,500
So far, he's been playing nice!

1044
01:17:47,180 --> 01:17:48,580
B-

1045
01:18:11,590 --> 01:18:19,590
Listen, everyone.

1046
01:18:19,591 --> 01:18:23,630
Everyone, even if the enemy shinobi do
manage to get up here, don't panic.

1047
01:18:23,870 --> 01:18:25,910
Just quickly get into the hidden chamber.

1048
01:18:28,650 --> 01:18:31,470
Don't worry, your Jonin
and Shunin sensei are here

1049
01:18:31,471 --> 01:18:34,411
to protect you, even
if it costs us our lives.

1050
01:18:45,360 --> 01:18:47,100
What is it, Konohamaru?

1051
01:18:48,300 --> 01:18:49,300
Don't worry.

1052
01:18:49,900 --> 01:18:51,440
It's not as bad as it looks.

1053
01:18:52,435 --> 01:18:54,380
Our people will drive the enemy away.

1054
01:19:04,980 --> 01:19:07,420
Lord Hokage's face is beginning to crack.

1055
01:19:08,690 --> 01:19:10,320
That's ominous.

1056
01:19:24,190 --> 01:19:27,100
Now, let me feel it.

1057
01:19:27,101 --> 01:19:30,120
That eye...

1058
01:19:32,540 --> 01:19:35,600
The same eye as before.

1059
01:20:14,770 --> 01:20:18,870
Shino... Looks like I may not finish
this before you catch up with me after all.

1060
01:20:19,990 --> 01:20:20,990
Shino...

1061
01:20:27,080 --> 01:20:29,390
The poison spreading slowly through his
system.

1062
01:20:30,250 --> 01:20:31,510
Now to finish it.

1063
01:20:41,070 --> 01:20:41,590
What?

1064
01:20:41,591 --> 01:20:42,591
More bugs?

1065
01:20:43,030 --> 01:20:45,730
He shouldn't even be moving with that
poison in him.

1066
01:20:50,550 --> 01:20:52,670
Let me put you out of your misery.

1067
01:20:54,710 --> 01:20:55,710
What the?

1068
01:20:55,910 --> 01:20:57,010
What's going on?

1069
01:21:00,090 --> 01:21:01,970
What the hell's wrong with it?

1070
01:21:05,050 --> 01:21:06,970
So that's what he was after.

1071
01:21:07,170 --> 01:21:12,250
He wanted me to attack, so he could get
his creepy crawlies to infest Crow's body.

1072
01:21:12,790 --> 01:21:15,410
Now they're going after my chakra puppet
strings.

1073
01:21:16,170 --> 01:21:17,170
Why?

1074
01:21:18,130 --> 01:21:18,750
Right.

1075
01:21:18,970 --> 01:21:21,430
I forgot these things eat chakra.

1076
01:21:26,570 --> 01:21:29,590
My strings are leading the bugs right to
me.

1077
01:21:33,830 --> 01:21:36,430
He severed his chakra strings himself.

1078
01:21:42,750 --> 01:21:48,490
What a sucker!

1079
01:21:48,930 --> 01:21:53,430
He doesn't know I can re-establish control
over my puppet in the blink of an eye.

1080
01:21:53,650 --> 01:21:56,390
It's what makes me an expert puppet
master.

1081
01:21:58,910 --> 01:21:59,550
I'm not an expert puppet master.

1082
01:21:59,551 --> 01:21:59,570
I've got a lot of experience with puppets.

1083
01:21:59,571 --> 01:22:01,730
Like you underestimated me, bug boy.

1084
01:22:02,510 --> 01:22:07,730
For the last time, there's enough poison
on that to drop an elephant, so...

1085
01:22:08,450 --> 01:22:09,450
you're dead.

1086
01:22:18,340 --> 01:22:19,920
These stinking beetles!

1087
01:22:20,280 --> 01:22:22,820
They ate through my chocolate strings at
the source!

1088
01:22:34,010 --> 01:22:35,010
But how?

1089
01:22:35,160 --> 01:22:36,360
I don't get it!

1090
01:22:36,460 --> 01:22:39,120
I was sure to cut the strings before they
could find me!

1091
01:22:40,360 --> 01:22:41,840
And there's your explanation.

1092
01:22:42,240 --> 01:22:45,180
You were so worried about them approaching
from the front...

1093
01:22:45,800 --> 01:22:50,620
that you failed to observe the swarm of
beetles coming at you from behind.

1094
01:22:53,480 --> 01:22:57,080
All this time, they've been slowly closing
in on you.

1095
01:22:57,680 --> 01:22:59,020
Drawn to your headband.

1096
01:22:59,700 --> 01:23:00,100
Huh?

1097
01:23:00,400 --> 01:23:01,400
To my what?

1098
01:23:01,660 --> 01:23:05,280
When I swung at you earlier, I only
pretended to miss.

1099
01:23:05,720 --> 01:23:08,960
What I really wanted was to plant a beetle
on your headband.

1100
01:23:09,740 --> 01:23:12,910
So then, this bug crawling on my
forehead...

1101
01:23:13,560 --> 01:23:14,760
is a female.

1102
01:23:15,720 --> 01:23:16,720
Yes.

1103
01:23:24,800 --> 01:23:28,540
The poison... it spread through my whole
body.

1104
01:23:31,270 --> 01:23:34,200
Looks like... I may not make it after all.

1105
01:23:35,560 --> 01:23:37,240
Sasuke Uchiha...

1106
01:23:41,780 --> 01:23:44,520
I won't let you get away!

1107
01:23:44,980 --> 01:23:47,180
You can't escape, do you hear?

1108
01:23:47,560 --> 01:23:49,240
Sasuke Uchiha!

1109
01:24:07,780 --> 01:24:10,408
You must remain in
front of them while I do a

1110
01:24:10,409 --> 01:24:13,661
This is unreal, his
strength is off the charts!

1111
01:24:14,200 --> 01:24:15,200
What's wrong?

1112
01:24:15,300 --> 01:24:16,540
Are you not afraid of me?

1113
01:24:16,900 --> 01:24:20,080
If this comes down to physical strength,
forget it.

1114
01:24:20,440 --> 01:24:21,640
Yes, that's it!

1115
01:24:21,641 --> 01:24:23,260
You fear me!

1116
01:24:23,480 --> 01:24:24,840
Don't you, Uchiha?

1117
01:24:25,120 --> 01:24:27,920
You live in fear every day I'm alive!

1118
01:24:28,560 --> 01:24:33,800
Has all your hatred and sense of purpose
dwindled down to this, abject fear?

1119
01:24:34,610 --> 01:24:37,900
Is this the existence you live now,
that of a coward?

1120
01:24:38,850 --> 01:24:40,240
Come out and fight me.

1121
01:24:40,915 --> 01:24:42,440
Show me that I'm wrong.

1122
01:24:43,795 --> 01:24:47,080
Prove that your existence is stronger than
mine.

1123
01:24:47,081 --> 01:24:49,800
You'll never know unless you fight me.

1124
01:24:49,920 --> 01:24:51,720
You'll never feel it!

1125
01:24:52,320 --> 01:24:53,320
Attack!

1126
01:25:14,330 --> 01:25:15,330
Good.

1127
01:25:16,870 --> 01:25:18,850
Now we're gonna have some fun!

1128
01:25:19,390 --> 01:25:20,670
Sasuke Uchiha!

1129
01:25:23,630 --> 01:25:26,090
With one blow, I'll finish this!

1130
01:25:39,900 --> 01:25:40,900
Gaara!

1131
01:26:10,400 --> 01:26:15,700
Now it's clear to me exactly why I've been
looking forward to this.

1132
01:26:16,340 --> 01:26:22,220
This pain... What a thrill it will
be to crush such an opponent!

1133
01:26:22,560 --> 01:26:23,820
Capable of winning!

1134
01:26:23,821 --> 01:26:25,000
Defeating me so badly!

1135
01:26:25,300 --> 01:26:29,100
Such a victory will make me feel what it
is to be truly alive!

1136
01:26:30,840 --> 01:26:32,960
No one has ever wounded Gaara.

1137
01:26:33,560 --> 01:26:35,100
And he's done it twice.

1138
01:26:36,740 --> 01:26:38,320
He's a freak of nature.

1139
01:26:39,080 --> 01:26:40,160
Like Gaara.

1140
01:26:41,420 --> 01:26:44,480
But this one's a freak in every fiber of
his body.

1141
01:26:45,460 --> 01:26:49,420
For all Gaara's strength, it's only his
right arm that's been transformed.

1142
01:26:50,860 --> 01:26:51,860
Ugh...

1143
01:26:52,080 --> 01:26:53,080
Yeah...

1144
01:26:53,780 --> 01:26:54,620
There's more.

1145
01:26:54,720 --> 01:26:55,900
So much more!

1146
01:26:56,560 --> 01:26:57,560
What the...

1147
01:27:07,820 --> 01:27:10,140
What the hell is this guy?

1148
01:27:10,560 --> 01:27:13,160
How many of these things are gonna grow
out of him?

1149
01:27:20,340 --> 01:27:21,440
He's even faster!

1150
01:27:32,660 --> 01:27:36,240
Only by predicting his moves, do I have
any chance of dodging him.

1151
01:27:36,780 --> 01:27:39,140
Without my shotgun, I'd be dead already.

1152
01:27:39,980 --> 01:27:40,980
Uh...

1153
01:27:42,860 --> 01:27:45,660
You can't use my Chidori!

1154
01:27:45,920 --> 01:27:47,100
Fire Style!

1155
01:27:47,380 --> 01:27:48,860
Fireball Jutsu!

1156
01:27:57,020 --> 01:28:01,380
Even slowing down... this level of Jutsu
is useless!

1157
01:28:02,060 --> 01:28:03,660
You're finished!

1158
01:28:04,580 --> 01:28:06,760
It's a Chidori or nothing!

1159
01:28:18,350 --> 01:28:21,740
I'm not going to let you get away with
this!

1160
01:28:27,700 --> 01:28:30,380
So, looks like you're good for two bursts.

1161
01:28:30,740 --> 01:28:32,140
That's about your limit.

1162
01:28:35,415 --> 01:28:38,033
At this stage of your
chakra development, you've

1163
01:28:38,034 --> 01:28:40,961
only got two shots of
Chidori in you per day.

1164
01:28:41,095 --> 01:28:44,940
And you weren't using your Sharingan,
which you would be in an actual battle.

1165
01:28:47,020 --> 01:28:50,620
Sharingan and Chidori are a potent
combination, but costly.

1166
01:28:51,320 --> 01:28:54,540
Using them simultaneously burns up a lot
of chakra.

1167
01:28:54,830 --> 01:28:55,830
And fast.

1168
01:28:57,335 --> 01:28:58,335
Don't sweat it.

1169
01:28:58,380 --> 01:28:59,580
I'm actually very impressed.

1170
01:29:00,580 --> 01:29:02,180
Even for me, Chidori's a killer.

1171
01:29:02,840 --> 01:29:07,840
If I had to use the Lightning Blade four
times in one day, I'd be running on empty.

1172
01:29:10,510 --> 01:29:14,100
What would happen if I tried to use it
more than twice?

1173
01:29:15,570 --> 01:29:17,740
Well, for one thing, it wouldn't work.

1174
01:29:17,905 --> 01:29:19,400
But remember this.

1175
01:29:20,480 --> 01:29:24,064
If you try to force a Jutsu,
not only will it not work,

1176
01:29:24,065 --> 01:29:27,700
but the attempt can drain
your chakra to absolute zero.

1177
01:29:28,950 --> 01:29:31,000
Worst case scenario, you die.

1178
01:29:33,860 --> 01:29:38,020
Even if the worst doesn't happen,
nothing good can come of it.

1179
01:29:38,300 --> 01:29:39,300
Trust me.

1180
01:29:40,200 --> 01:29:41,860
Especially in your case.

1181
01:29:48,840 --> 01:29:50,680
I'm not going to tell you how it works.

1182
01:29:50,681 --> 01:29:51,681
Is that it?

1183
01:29:51,960 --> 01:29:58,220
That was the best demonstration you could
make of the value of your existence?

1184
01:29:58,900 --> 01:30:01,480
That's just pathetic, truly.

1185
01:30:05,440 --> 01:30:08,260
Your hatred, it's weak.

1186
01:30:08,480 --> 01:30:10,980
You're far too soft and forgiving.

1187
01:30:14,100 --> 01:30:17,180
The greater the hunger for revenge,
the greater the hate.

1188
01:30:17,440 --> 01:30:21,200
And it's the power of hate that gives you
the strength to kill.

1189
01:30:22,120 --> 01:30:23,400
Shut up.

1190
01:30:25,280 --> 01:30:27,820
You know what that means, don't you?

1191
01:30:28,140 --> 01:30:29,140
Just shut up!

1192
01:30:29,940 --> 01:30:31,980
It means you can't win.

1193
01:30:32,440 --> 01:30:35,360
You are weaker than I am!

1194
01:30:36,380 --> 01:30:39,060
There's a reason Itachi let me live.

1195
01:30:39,061 --> 01:30:44,180
The reason he chose me to be the one to
track him down and kill him.

1196
01:30:44,540 --> 01:30:47,500
I am an Avenger!

1197
01:30:55,540 --> 01:30:56,680
The curse...

1198
01:31:17,350 --> 01:31:18,350
The

1199
01:31:43,140 --> 01:31:44,400
curse mark again?

1200
01:31:49,840 --> 01:31:53,320
I can't... I can't move my body!

1201
01:32:08,280 --> 01:32:13,690
I can't move my body!

1202
01:32:13,691 --> 01:32:16,470
This... This guy...

1203
01:32:17,410 --> 01:32:18,690
S-Sasuke!

1204
01:32:22,970 --> 01:32:25,050
What... what are you doing here?

1205
01:32:26,390 --> 01:32:29,290
He's losing control again, just like
before!

1206
01:32:35,670 --> 01:32:36,790
Sasuke, hold on!

1207
01:32:37,710 --> 01:32:40,550
Kakashi-sensei said that bruise was
nothing to worry about!

1208
01:32:40,970 --> 01:32:45,250
Hey, uh... Sakura... Earth to Sakura!

1209
01:32:45,251 --> 01:32:47,510
What do you want?!

1210
01:32:47,511 --> 01:32:49,390
This guy over here!

1211
01:32:49,530 --> 01:32:51,130
Who the hell is he?!

1212
01:32:51,131 --> 01:32:53,810
His outward appearance may be different.

1213
01:32:55,270 --> 01:32:57,630
But he's the one you know as Gaara.

1214
01:32:58,230 --> 01:33:01,150
I was born a monster.

1215
01:33:03,170 --> 01:33:05,490
So this is what he was talking about!

1216
01:33:06,370 --> 01:33:08,830
He did this... to Sasuke!

1217
01:33:09,190 --> 01:33:10,290
Hey, little girl.

1218
01:33:10,810 --> 01:33:14,310
I guess now would be the time to tell you
I'm not the fighting type.

1219
01:33:14,311 --> 01:33:16,550
I can see that by looking at you!

1220
01:33:19,030 --> 01:33:20,030
Sasuke!

1221
01:33:21,070 --> 01:33:22,350
So... it's you.

1222
01:33:23,810 --> 01:33:26,130
You're the one I didn't kill that day.

1223
01:33:29,870 --> 01:33:31,070
Guys, get up!

1224
01:33:31,130 --> 01:33:32,130
We have to go now!

1225
01:33:33,970 --> 01:33:35,710
Die, Sasuke Uchiha!

1226
01:33:40,270 --> 01:33:41,270
Move it!

1227
01:33:55,635 --> 01:33:57,160
Sakura!

1228
01:33:59,060 --> 01:34:00,460
Sakura!

1229
01:34:27,700 --> 01:34:28,700
Mommy?

1230
01:34:40,900 --> 01:34:42,220
Am I...?

1231
01:34:45,640 --> 01:34:47,240
Am I...?

1232
01:35:25,380 --> 01:35:26,780
Hey, that's so cool!

1233
01:35:27,260 --> 01:35:28,260
Hm?

1234
01:35:37,610 --> 01:35:38,610
Ah...

1235
01:35:40,470 --> 01:35:42,230
What about... food shapes?

1236
01:35:42,370 --> 01:35:43,370
Can you do that?

1237
01:35:45,110 --> 01:35:46,110
Uh...

1238
01:35:48,030 --> 01:35:50,031
Huh... Huh?

1239
01:35:54,450 --> 01:35:55,050
Whoa!

1240
01:35:55,310 --> 01:35:56,310
Grilled squid!

1241
01:35:57,350 --> 01:35:58,550
Oh...

1242
01:36:00,290 --> 01:36:01,490
Ramen!

1243
01:36:07,830 --> 01:36:09,350
Uh... cherries!

1244
01:36:11,890 --> 01:36:13,090
Lobster!

1245
01:36:16,930 --> 01:36:18,950
Uh... sea urchin rice bowl!

1246
01:36:19,800 --> 01:36:23,150
How about...

1247
01:36:24,400 --> 01:36:25,590
A really big poop.

1248
01:36:25,910 --> 01:36:26,910
Can you do that?

1249
01:36:32,990 --> 01:36:33,990
Tamari.

1250
01:36:34,990 --> 01:36:35,990
Kankuro.

1251
01:36:36,150 --> 01:36:37,150
Yes, sir.

1252
01:36:43,160 --> 01:36:44,160
Gaara.

1253
01:36:44,440 --> 01:36:45,440
Tamari.

1254
01:36:46,140 --> 01:36:47,140
Yes?

1255
01:36:49,000 --> 01:36:50,000
Hmm...

1256
01:36:53,000 --> 01:36:54,000
Hmm...

1257
01:37:15,480 --> 01:37:16,740
Hey, Yashimaru.

1258
01:37:17,750 --> 01:37:20,320
I don't seem to get sleepy even when it's
nighttime.

1259
01:37:20,860 --> 01:37:21,860
Why is that?

1260
01:37:23,410 --> 01:37:25,040
Now, that's a problem.

1261
01:37:26,840 --> 01:37:29,740
Normally, when you close your eyes,
you should get tired.

1262
01:37:30,180 --> 01:37:31,180
Oh, really?

1263
01:37:35,660 --> 01:37:37,621
Hey... why... Hm?

1264
01:37:38,600 --> 01:37:40,120
Why don't I have a mother?

1265
01:37:40,850 --> 01:37:41,850
Oh, uh...

1266
01:37:44,300 --> 01:37:47,460
Instead of a mother, you get to have me,
Lord Gaara.

1267
01:37:49,710 --> 01:37:54,100
And that... is because I'm going to remain
by your side... always.

1268
01:37:55,200 --> 01:37:56,200
Hm...

1269
01:38:10,170 --> 01:38:11,170
Oh...

1270
01:38:13,250 --> 01:38:14,250
Hm...

1271
01:38:19,060 --> 01:38:20,060
Oh...

1272
01:38:20,860 --> 01:38:21,860
Hm?

1273
01:38:28,935 --> 01:38:29,935
Hm...

1274
01:38:51,910 --> 01:38:53,990
Oh... is it lunchtime?

1275
01:38:54,250 --> 01:38:55,250
Mm-hm.

1276
01:38:57,850 --> 01:38:58,410
Yeah!

1277
01:38:58,670 --> 01:38:59,230
Good kick!

1278
01:38:59,690 --> 01:39:00,110
Come on!

1279
01:39:00,111 --> 01:39:01,030
Come on!

1280
01:39:01,031 --> 01:39:02,031
He looks to me!

1281
01:39:03,210 --> 01:39:04,010
Quickies open!

1282
01:39:04,230 --> 01:39:04,910
Pass it!

1283
01:39:05,150 --> 01:39:06,170
Power shot!

1284
01:39:10,500 --> 01:39:12,530
Oh, man, now what do we do?

1285
01:39:13,720 --> 01:39:15,510
I don't know any wall climbing,
Jutsu.

1286
01:39:15,690 --> 01:39:16,690
Do you?

1287
01:39:24,165 --> 01:39:26,160
Is... him!

1288
01:39:27,380 --> 01:39:29,341
E... Uh...

1289
01:39:33,870 --> 01:39:34,870
Here.

1290
01:39:35,470 --> 01:39:36,510
It's that Gaara!

1291
01:39:36,770 --> 01:39:37,770
Run!

1292
01:39:38,730 --> 01:39:40,770
Run, run!

1293
01:39:41,150 --> 01:39:41,430
Run!

1294
01:39:41,431 --> 01:39:42,431
Watch the cảps!

1295
01:39:45,710 --> 01:39:46,710
No wait!

1296
01:39:47,030 --> 01:39:48,270
Don't run away!

1297
01:39:53,020 --> 01:39:54,020
Please.

1298
01:39:55,760 --> 01:40:00,180
I don't wanna be alone
anymore... Ahhhhhh...

1299
01:40:15,200 --> 01:40:16,400
No, Gaara!

1300
01:40:16,580 --> 01:40:17,840
You can't do this!

1301
01:40:35,570 --> 01:40:37,830
It doesn't matter what I do.

1302
01:40:38,410 --> 01:40:40,490
The sand just gets in the way.

1303
01:40:42,490 --> 01:40:43,490
Gaara...

1304
01:40:44,870 --> 01:40:45,870
Yashimaru...

1305
01:40:46,650 --> 01:40:51,470
As a member of the Medical Corps,
our leader, Lord Kazekage, has asked that

1306
01:40:51,471 --> 01:40:53,730
I see to your safety and well-being
personally.

1307
01:40:55,010 --> 01:40:57,450
Please, Gaara, it hurts me to see you do
that.

1308
01:41:01,110 --> 01:41:02,150
Yashimaru... sorry.

1309
01:41:02,930 --> 01:41:04,410
What, this?

1310
01:41:05,220 --> 01:41:07,410
Don't worry, it's barely more than a
scratch.

1311
01:41:10,200 --> 01:41:11,470
The wound you got...

1312
01:41:11,995 --> 01:41:13,310
Does it hurt?

1313
01:41:14,050 --> 01:41:15,050
Hm.

1314
01:41:16,200 --> 01:41:17,200
Yes, a little bit.

1315
01:41:17,890 --> 01:41:19,230
But it'll heal in no time.

1316
01:41:19,850 --> 01:41:20,850
Hm...

1317
01:41:22,050 --> 01:41:24,030
What does pain feel like?

1318
01:41:24,190 --> 01:41:25,190
Hm?

1319
01:41:26,130 --> 01:41:29,079
You see, I've never
actually been injured

1320
01:41:29,080 --> 01:41:33,371
before, and I was
wondering what it was like.

1321
01:41:34,170 --> 01:41:35,170
Hm...

1322
01:41:35,670 --> 01:41:41,050
How can I put it, it's very difficult,
or maybe upsetting's what I mean.

1323
01:41:41,070 --> 01:41:41,450
Hm...

1324
01:41:42,090 --> 01:41:45,330
It's like when someone is struck or cut.

1325
01:41:45,725 --> 01:41:47,890
It's a feeling that's very hard to take.

1326
01:41:48,370 --> 01:41:50,770
When you're hurt, you don't feel normal.

1327
01:41:52,740 --> 01:41:54,430
I'm not explaining it very well.

1328
01:41:54,610 --> 01:41:58,090
Basically, it's a situation you want to
avoid if at all possible.

1329
01:42:00,480 --> 01:42:05,350
I think I might be hurting too,
just like everyone else.

1330
01:42:05,510 --> 01:42:10,590
I know I'm not bleeding, but lately I've
felt a lot of pain here.

1331
01:42:22,665 --> 01:42:27,040
Wound your body, and the blood will flow
following fast on the heels of pain.

1332
01:42:28,050 --> 01:42:30,540
But as time passes, the pain eventually
fades away.

1333
01:42:31,830 --> 01:42:34,000
With the help of medicine, it can heal
even faster.

1334
01:42:35,570 --> 01:42:38,106
But even more dangerous
is a wound dealt to the heart,

1335
01:42:38,107 --> 01:42:40,780
because there's nothing
that has more trouble healing.

1336
01:42:41,950 --> 01:42:43,040
A wound to the heart?

1337
01:42:44,135 --> 01:42:46,980
Wounds to the heart are a little different
from wounds to the flesh.

1338
01:42:48,010 --> 01:42:50,648
Unlike an injury to the
body, there is no medicine

1339
01:42:50,649 --> 01:42:53,280
for a wounded heart, and
sometimes it never heals.

1340
01:43:00,390 --> 01:43:01,390
But don't worry.

1341
01:43:01,590 --> 01:43:04,410
There is one thing that can mend a broken
heart.

1342
01:43:05,490 --> 01:43:08,150
But it's a very complicated remedy.

1343
01:43:08,795 --> 01:43:11,430
It can only be administered to you by
another person.

1344
01:43:11,630 --> 01:43:13,770
So then, what am I supposed to do?

1345
01:43:14,795 --> 01:43:16,810
There's one thing that can heal the heart.

1346
01:43:17,530 --> 01:43:18,530
Only one.

1347
01:43:20,400 --> 01:43:21,400
What is it?

1348
01:43:21,635 --> 01:43:22,870
It's love, Gaara.

1349
01:43:23,850 --> 01:43:24,850
Love?

1350
01:43:25,190 --> 01:43:26,190
You've got it.

1351
01:43:26,350 --> 01:43:28,730
But... but how am I supposed to get rid of
it?

1352
01:43:29,095 --> 01:43:31,110
What is it I have to do to get rid of this
pain?

1353
01:43:31,450 --> 01:43:32,570
Don't you know, Gaara?

1354
01:43:33,070 --> 01:43:34,990
It has already been given to you.

1355
01:43:36,050 --> 01:43:44,050
Love is... the heart's desire to serve
someone precious to you.

1356
01:43:44,380 --> 01:43:45,650
To watch over them.

1357
01:43:46,050 --> 01:43:47,110
To care for them.

1358
01:43:47,750 --> 01:43:49,150
Like my sister did for you.

1359
01:43:49,870 --> 01:43:53,630
There's no question that my older sister
always loved you.

1360
01:43:54,280 --> 01:43:59,070
The sand automatically rushes to protect
you, just like the love of a mother.

1361
01:43:59,840 --> 01:44:04,030
I believe your mother's will is carried in
every grain of that sand.

1362
01:44:06,720 --> 01:44:12,150
My sister, even after death, wants more
than anything to protect you.

1363
01:44:16,230 --> 01:44:17,030
Yashimaru... Huh?

1364
01:44:17,680 --> 01:44:18,680
What is it, Gaara?

1365
01:44:19,680 --> 01:44:21,330
Thank you for all of your help.

1366
01:44:21,990 --> 01:44:23,530
You know, for stopping me before.

1367
01:44:24,810 --> 01:44:25,810
You're very welcome.

1368
01:44:27,330 --> 01:44:29,630
After all, you're special, Gaara.

1369
01:44:29,690 --> 01:44:31,090
I hold you very dear to me.

1370
01:44:42,250 --> 01:44:45,320
Can you understand the pain that I feel?

1371
01:44:52,310 --> 01:44:54,290
It tastes like iron.

1372
01:44:57,710 --> 01:44:58,750
Hey, Yashimaru.

1373
01:44:59,110 --> 01:45:00,810
I have a favor to ask.

1374
01:45:01,559 --> 01:45:02,559
What is it?

1375
01:45:03,310 --> 01:45:05,170
I need some of your medicine.

1376
01:45:15,485 --> 01:45:16,800
Sorry about earlier.

1377
01:45:17,650 --> 01:45:18,780
I know it must have hurt.

1378
01:45:19,450 --> 01:45:20,960
I brought you some medicine.

1379
01:45:21,380 --> 01:45:22,380
If you want.

1380
01:45:22,540 --> 01:45:23,540
Get out of here!

1381
01:45:23,960 --> 01:45:24,960
Freak!

1382
01:45:36,980 --> 01:45:37,980
I was right.

1383
01:45:39,135 --> 01:45:40,410
No one wants me.

1384
01:45:43,510 --> 01:45:44,510
Why?

1385
01:45:45,130 --> 01:45:47,610
Why do I have to be such a freak?

1386
01:45:48,910 --> 01:45:50,590
What am I?

1387
01:45:52,510 --> 01:45:56,410
Only one thing cures a wounded heart,
and that's love, Gaara.

1388
01:45:59,250 --> 01:46:00,250
Yashimaru...

1389
01:46:01,990 --> 01:46:03,030
I know nothing about love.

1390
01:46:12,570 --> 01:46:14,310
No one understands love.

1391
01:46:14,311 --> 01:46:15,410
Why, Gaara?

1392
01:46:15,411 --> 01:46:16,411
Why me?

1393
01:46:16,730 --> 01:46:18,890
Why is it always me?

1394
01:46:19,310 --> 01:46:25,650
Why me?

1395
01:46:25,990 --> 01:46:26,950
Why me?

1396
01:46:26,951 --> 01:46:27,951
Why me?

1397
01:46:28,790 --> 01:46:29,790
Why

1398
01:46:34,280 --> 01:46:35,280
me?

1399
01:46:59,760 --> 01:47:01,660
You did well, Gaara.

1400
01:47:02,920 --> 01:47:03,920
You did very well.

1401
01:47:08,960 --> 01:47:10,540
Why, Yoshimaru?

1402
01:47:11,490 --> 01:47:12,940
Why did you do it?

1403
01:47:13,820 --> 01:47:15,620
I don't understand.

1404
01:47:20,820 --> 01:47:28,820
You see, I was ordered to kill you,
Gaara, by Lord Kazekage, your father.

1405
01:47:32,380 --> 01:47:34,060
My father...

1406
01:47:42,240 --> 01:47:43,480
Why me?

1407
01:47:43,840 --> 01:47:46,440
Why would... my father...

1408
01:47:47,360 --> 01:47:52,200
All these years you have been watched and
studied as part of a great experiment.

1409
01:47:53,060 --> 01:47:56,700
It became clear that you
could never control it, the

1410
01:47:56,701 --> 01:48:00,520
Shukaku that possesses
the power of the sand itself.

1411
01:48:01,680 --> 01:48:04,040
The day is coming when you will be able to
control it.

1412
01:48:04,060 --> 01:48:07,000
And your existence will be too dangerous
for the village.

1413
01:48:07,840 --> 01:48:10,440
It had to be done before then.

1414
01:48:12,840 --> 01:48:15,800
You... you had to obey my father.

1415
01:48:16,380 --> 01:48:18,420
You didn't have any choice.

1416
01:48:20,320 --> 01:48:20,920
You're wrong.

1417
01:48:21,340 --> 01:48:22,860
I had a choice.

1418
01:48:25,500 --> 01:48:28,480
Yes, Lord Kazekage made his wishes known
to me.

1419
01:48:29,360 --> 01:48:32,540
But... I could have refused if I had
chosen to.

1420
01:48:35,810 --> 01:48:41,700
I suppose it's because, deep in my heart,
I hate you, Gaara.

1421
01:48:43,340 --> 01:48:45,320
I've always hated you.

1422
01:48:47,200 --> 01:48:49,960
My sister died bringing you into this
world.

1423
01:48:50,860 --> 01:48:52,420
I can't forgive you for that.

1424
01:48:54,010 --> 01:48:56,500
I told myself that you were all that was
left of her.

1425
01:48:56,800 --> 01:48:59,880
And since I loved her, I should love you.

1426
01:49:01,000 --> 01:49:03,460
I tried, but I never could.

1427
01:49:04,590 --> 01:49:09,580
It wasn't her choice to have you... to be
made a human sacrifice.

1428
01:49:10,610 --> 01:49:13,520
And so she died, cursing this village.

1429
01:49:15,005 --> 01:49:20,580
The day she died, I felt a wound in my
heart that I knew would never heal.

1430
01:49:21,940 --> 01:49:25,400
Your name is... the one your mother gave
you.

1431
01:49:27,700 --> 01:49:29,300
Your name is Gaara.

1432
01:49:29,700 --> 01:49:31,840
A demon that loves only itself.

1433
01:49:32,660 --> 01:49:34,040
Your name is Gaara.

1434
01:49:34,040 --> 01:49:34,040
A demon that loves only itself.

1435
01:49:34,041 --> 01:49:35,480
Love no one else.

1436
01:49:36,080 --> 01:49:38,800
Care for no one's existence but your own.

1437
01:49:39,400 --> 01:49:41,480
Fight only for yourself.

1438
01:49:42,400 --> 01:49:44,820
In that way, you will be sure to survive.

1439
01:49:45,840 --> 01:49:48,760
This is the dying gift your mother left
you.

1440
01:49:49,180 --> 01:49:51,240
But not out of maternal affection.

1441
01:49:52,200 --> 01:49:55,660
It was not from love that she gave you
your name.

1442
01:49:58,720 --> 01:50:02,520
It was from her undying rage at this
village.

1443
01:50:02,521 --> 01:50:05,040
It was part of her curse.

1444
01:50:05,640 --> 01:50:08,160
That you should survive and grow.

1445
01:50:10,480 --> 01:50:13,460
Her hate lives on in you.

1446
01:50:29,680 --> 01:50:31,860
You were never loved, Gaara.

1447
01:50:33,180 --> 01:50:34,180
Never.

1448
01:50:41,140 --> 01:50:42,520
This is the end.

1449
01:51:02,675 --> 01:51:06,760
There's no question that my older sister
always loved you.

1450
01:51:07,940 --> 01:51:08,940
Love?

1451
01:51:25,000 --> 01:51:26,400
Yeah!

1452
01:51:42,170 --> 01:51:49,210
You're the one I loved...

1453
01:51:53,250 --> 01:51:56,550
And this is the end.

1454
01:51:56,690 --> 01:51:57,070
But... Nanami...

1455
01:51:57,390 --> 01:51:59,810
Rhonda will only love her.

1456
01:51:59,811 --> 01:52:02,670
So that's Gaara.

1457
01:52:03,550 --> 01:52:04,550
Me.

1458
01:52:05,170 --> 01:52:07,390
I understand now.

1459
01:52:07,990 --> 01:52:09,270
I'm alone.

1460
01:52:09,970 --> 01:52:15,150
I'll no longer care about anyone and love
anyone else.

1461
01:52:15,650 --> 01:52:17,230
I'm all alone.

1462
01:52:20,890 --> 01:52:23,870
I am all that matters.

1463
01:52:31,230 --> 01:52:32,670
Those eyes...

1464
01:52:35,550 --> 01:52:36,910
What's the matter?

1465
01:52:37,410 --> 01:52:40,050
Weren't you about to make a run for it?

1466
01:52:42,530 --> 01:52:43,530
Sasuke...

1467
01:52:45,950 --> 01:52:46,950
Naruto...

1468
01:52:49,770 --> 01:52:51,590
Who are these two?

1469
01:52:53,630 --> 01:52:55,570
Who are they to you?

1470
01:52:57,590 --> 01:52:59,190
Who are they to me?

1471
01:52:59,810 --> 01:53:01,470
They're my friends is who they are!

1472
01:53:01,750 --> 01:53:07,911
You try laying so much as another finger on
the two of them, and I will pulverize you!

1473
01:53:13,310 --> 01:53:14,570
What's the matter?

1474
01:53:15,270 --> 01:53:17,770
Weren't you gonna pulverize me?

1475
01:53:20,550 --> 01:53:21,990
Well, come on then.

1476
01:53:29,810 --> 01:53:30,810
Damn it!

1477
01:53:38,760 --> 01:53:39,760
This guy!

1478
01:53:48,320 --> 01:53:51,340
This isn't gonna be easy as long as he
stays like this.

1479
01:53:54,040 --> 01:53:56,100
But I have no choice.

1480
01:53:58,120 --> 01:54:01,540
This is gonna use up a heck of a lot of
chakra, but...

1481
01:54:02,080 --> 01:54:05,120
It's time to bring in the Chief Toad!

1482
01:54:07,580 --> 01:54:08,580
Summoning Jutsu!

1483
01:54:13,220 --> 01:54:14,140
What is it?

1484
01:54:14,240 --> 01:54:15,240
What do you want, kid?

1485
01:54:15,630 --> 01:54:17,950
Well, whatever it is, I hope you brought
along some treats.

1486
01:54:18,040 --> 01:54:20,416
Because if you think I'm doing anything
for nothing, you're wrong!

1487
01:54:20,440 --> 01:54:20,680
No!

1488
01:54:20,681 --> 01:54:21,460
Give me a break!

1489
01:54:21,700 --> 01:54:23,920
I'm really starting to hate you stinking
frogs!

1490
01:54:24,320 --> 01:54:24,760
Ho, ho, ho!

1491
01:54:24,860 --> 01:54:25,860
Anti-amphibian, huh?

1492
01:54:25,920 --> 01:54:27,160
Well, take that, you big bigot!

1493
01:54:28,000 --> 01:54:28,480
Listen!

1494
01:54:28,980 --> 01:54:31,800
I don't have time to play games,
you slimy little squirt!

1495
01:54:33,920 --> 01:54:35,300
I can't believe it!

1496
01:54:35,620 --> 01:54:38,300
After all my training, this is the best I
can do?

1497
01:54:38,660 --> 01:54:40,340
I'll just have to make it work!

1498
01:54:40,680 --> 01:54:42,840
I'm the only one who can save them!

1499
01:54:44,100 --> 01:54:45,520
Worried about the others?

1500
01:54:46,020 --> 01:54:47,640
That's your big mistake!

1501
01:54:48,300 --> 01:54:51,420
When I fight, I fight for me and me alone!

1502
01:54:55,280 --> 01:54:56,280
Huh?

1503
01:54:57,580 --> 01:54:59,440
He's transforming again!

1504
01:55:03,140 --> 01:55:06,880
Only by attacking and defeating me can you
free her.

1505
01:55:07,140 --> 01:55:08,740
And you should hurry.

1506
01:55:08,900 --> 01:55:14,300
With each passing second, the sand will
harden... until it crushes her to death.

1507
01:55:15,500 --> 01:55:16,500
Sakura!

1508
01:55:17,280 --> 01:55:20,380
He's getting closer and closer to a total
possession.

1509
01:55:21,520 --> 01:55:24,900
And if that happens, none of us will
survive.

1510
01:55:26,480 --> 01:55:27,600
Sand shuriken!

1511
01:55:33,440 --> 01:55:34,440
Wow!

1512
01:55:37,820 --> 01:55:38,820
Boy, are you pathetic!

1513
01:55:39,560 --> 01:55:40,560
Shut up!

1514
01:55:40,620 --> 01:55:42,480
So, uh, who the heck is this freak anyway?

1515
01:55:43,000 --> 01:55:44,000
Huh!

1516
01:55:52,540 --> 01:55:54,200
Eyes full of loneliness...

1517
01:55:55,020 --> 01:55:58,820
I don't know how it happened, but this
guy's been there.

1518
01:55:58,940 --> 01:56:03,360
All alone, in that same bottomless pit of
darkness and pain.

1519
01:56:03,980 --> 01:56:05,380
He's still there.

1520
01:56:06,235 --> 01:56:07,500
That's why he has no one.

1521
01:56:07,640 --> 01:56:09,280
He fights only for himself.

1522
01:56:13,200 --> 01:56:14,380
What's the matter?

1523
01:56:14,740 --> 01:56:16,600
Are you afraid of me?

1524
01:56:16,800 --> 01:56:20,440
Or are you still thinking of the best way
to save your friends?

1525
01:56:21,140 --> 01:56:21,740
Fool!

1526
01:56:22,080 --> 01:56:23,120
Forget them!

1527
01:56:23,121 --> 01:56:25,160
Think only of yourself!

1528
01:56:25,480 --> 01:56:27,180
Love only yourself!

1529
01:56:27,660 --> 01:56:30,180
That is what it means to be the strongest!

1530
01:56:30,660 --> 01:56:31,660
What's wrong?

1531
01:56:32,060 --> 01:56:34,540
You were so bold and cocky before!

1532
01:56:35,040 --> 01:56:36,960
Show me your strength!

1533
01:56:37,280 --> 01:56:40,720
Let me grind it into dust before your
eyes!

1534
01:56:41,420 --> 01:56:43,060
Attack, you coward!

1535
01:56:43,320 --> 01:56:46,080
Fight me or I'll kill the girl right now!

1536
01:56:49,540 --> 01:56:51,760
Okay, you asked for it!

1537
01:56:51,840 --> 01:56:53,860
Multi-shadow clone jutsu!

1538
01:56:56,800 --> 01:56:58,400
Wind style...

1539
01:57:00,600 --> 01:57:02,200
Shensong Devastation!

1540
01:57:06,760 --> 01:57:09,160
He just blew him away!

1541
01:57:09,420 --> 01:57:10,420
Not good!

1542
01:57:10,720 --> 01:57:13,740
I think I'll toy with you a while.

1543
01:57:13,741 --> 01:57:18,800
I'll watch you abandon your friends and
beg for mercy before you die.

1544
01:57:25,440 --> 01:57:28,120
What... what the...

1545
01:57:29,375 --> 01:57:31,200
And again!

1546
01:57:38,750 --> 01:57:40,450
What's this feeling?

1547
01:57:41,610 --> 01:57:43,370
San Shuriken!

1548
01:57:49,990 --> 01:57:52,430
What's this... this strange feeling?

1549
01:57:53,190 --> 01:57:54,550
Getting stronger!

1550
01:57:55,230 --> 01:57:57,310
He... what's he doing?

1551
01:57:57,670 --> 01:57:59,170
Flowing through me!

1552
01:57:59,470 --> 01:58:02,210
As if I was on fire!

1553
01:58:03,610 --> 01:58:05,150
I see it now!

1554
01:58:05,410 --> 01:58:06,950
I can't lose!

1555
01:58:08,450 --> 01:58:09,450
Weakling!

1556
01:58:11,280 --> 01:58:14,090
I have to beat him, even if it kills me!

1557
01:58:14,450 --> 01:58:16,010
What is this?

1558
01:58:16,011 --> 01:58:18,930
You come at me and that's all you've got?

1559
01:58:19,270 --> 01:58:24,550
All that effort... and you couldn't
even touch me... What a joke!

1560
01:58:27,170 --> 01:58:28,170
Sakura...

1561
01:58:31,810 --> 01:58:34,890
I don't really know how much damage I can
do...

1562
01:58:35,830 --> 01:58:37,030
But it doesn't matter!

1563
01:58:37,350 --> 01:58:39,390
I just have to give it my best shot!

1564
01:58:39,610 --> 01:58:40,970
Shadow clone jutsu!

1565
01:58:41,370 --> 01:58:42,370
Shadow clone jutsu!

1566
01:58:43,210 --> 01:58:44,590
Shadow clone jutsu!

1567
01:58:46,770 --> 01:58:47,770
Here goes!

1568
01:58:47,930 --> 01:58:50,410
Get ready for the ultimate secret
taijutsu!

1569
01:58:50,810 --> 01:58:52,350
Naruto Zanarki!

1570
01:58:52,730 --> 01:58:54,630
Clone body slam!

1571
01:59:00,650 --> 01:59:01,070
Okay!

1572
01:59:01,450 --> 01:59:02,710
Let's do it!

1573
01:59:04,150 --> 01:59:05,930
Shadow clone jutsu!

1574
01:59:07,610 --> 01:59:08,230
And another!

1575
01:59:08,570 --> 01:59:10,510
Shadow clone jutsu!

1576
01:59:11,750 --> 01:59:12,830
Take this!

1577
01:59:13,050 --> 01:59:14,730
Leaf Village secret taijutsu!

1578
01:59:14,731 --> 01:59:17,250
Straight from the teachings of
Kakashi-sensei!

1579
01:59:17,490 --> 01:59:19,430
A thousand years of death!

1580
01:59:23,630 --> 01:59:24,630
Boom!

1581
01:59:36,530 --> 01:59:40,450
All of that work... and you only scored
one blow?

1582
01:59:41,720 --> 01:59:43,070
Put a sock in it!

1583
01:59:44,730 --> 01:59:48,650
He attacked at the base of the tail,
where the defense is weakest.

1584
01:59:49,290 --> 01:59:53,870
He didn't wound me, but the sand couldn't
absorb the impact.

1585
01:59:54,970 --> 01:59:57,190
Have I underestimated him?

1586
02:00:01,670 --> 02:00:03,350
Naruto, listen to me.

1587
02:00:03,670 --> 02:00:07,990
You have to save Sakura if it's the last
thing you do.

1588
02:00:09,160 --> 02:00:13,730
Once you've got her, I want you to take
her and flee as fast as you can.

1589
02:00:14,730 --> 02:00:15,990
It's all up to you.

1590
02:00:18,920 --> 02:00:22,850
I can... hold him here... a little longer.

1591
02:00:25,815 --> 02:00:27,270
I lost everything once.

1592
02:00:27,860 --> 02:00:30,470
I don't ever want to have to see that
again.

1593
02:00:32,560 --> 02:00:36,150
My trusted comrades falling... right in
front of me.

1594
02:00:37,430 --> 02:00:38,430
Your comrades?

1595
02:00:39,385 --> 02:00:40,385
Sasuke...

1596
02:00:41,230 --> 02:00:44,270
I will not allow my comrades to die.

1597
02:00:44,590 --> 02:00:46,190
That is absolute.

1598
02:00:52,360 --> 02:00:53,920
I get it now.

1599
02:00:57,020 --> 02:00:58,200
Of course.

1600
02:01:01,020 --> 02:01:06,241
Going through life with the exact same
sadness and loneliness that I had to carry?

1601
02:01:06,270 --> 02:01:09,360
He fought only for himself, never relying
on anyone.

1602
02:01:09,460 --> 02:01:12,120
And because of that, I thought that he
possessed strength.

1603
02:01:12,121 --> 02:01:14,100
I really did.

1604
02:01:15,660 --> 02:01:17,580
Naruto... I don't know.

1605
02:01:17,740 --> 02:01:19,280
I guess I should have known better.

1606
02:01:19,520 --> 02:01:21,500
That's not what real strength is.

1607
02:01:21,700 --> 02:01:25,980
If you never fight for anyone but
yourself, you'll never be strong,

1608
02:01:26,140 --> 02:01:27,420
no matter what you do.

1609
02:01:29,440 --> 02:01:34,300
The truth is, when a person has something
precious they want to protect...

1610
02:01:37,520 --> 02:01:41,380
It's only then... that they become
genuinely strong.

1611
02:01:47,000 --> 02:01:48,520
You will get strong.

1612
02:01:49,140 --> 02:01:50,360
Very strong.

1613
02:01:55,480 --> 02:01:57,820
He's releasing a massive amount of chakra.

1614
02:01:58,800 --> 02:02:01,200
How is he... doing it?

1615
02:02:03,760 --> 02:02:06,180
No matter what happens...

1616
02:02:09,380 --> 02:02:11,960
I swear I'm going to protect you!

1617
02:02:17,220 --> 02:02:19,320
Come on, let's go!

1618
02:02:20,540 --> 02:02:23,100
The P. Shadow Claw Jutsu!

1619
02:02:28,760 --> 02:02:32,340
Gee, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to keep you
waiting so long.

1620
02:02:32,720 --> 02:02:36,880
So get ready for an original jutsu
straight from my ninja handbook.

1621
02:02:37,400 --> 02:02:40,600
What the... how could he have summoned so
many clones!

1622
02:02:41,080 --> 02:02:42,500
You gotta be kidding!

1623
02:02:42,501 --> 02:02:44,040
This is amazing!

1624
02:02:44,740 --> 02:02:46,760
I don't believe my eyes!

1625
02:02:47,400 --> 02:02:49,000
Way to go there, blondie!

1626
02:02:49,120 --> 02:02:50,800
You show an awful lot of promise!

1627
02:02:51,080 --> 02:02:53,120
How did you do this?

1628
02:02:53,700 --> 02:02:56,380
Sasuke, why don't you take it easy for a
while?

1629
02:02:56,520 --> 02:02:57,520
You deserve it!

1630
02:02:57,600 --> 02:03:00,420
Just leave the rest to Naruto Uzumaki!

1631
02:03:03,220 --> 02:03:04,560
What happened to him?

1632
02:03:05,380 --> 02:03:06,420
Bye, everyone!

1633
02:03:06,900 --> 02:03:07,780
Look out!

1634
02:03:07,880 --> 02:03:08,900
Here I go!

1635
02:03:10,860 --> 02:03:11,740
Unbelievable!

1636
02:03:11,741 --> 02:03:13,820
Is that Naruto?

1637
02:03:17,780 --> 02:03:19,240
Let's do this!

1638
02:03:19,900 --> 02:03:23,640
Direct from Naruto's Ninja Hammer!

1639
02:03:26,460 --> 02:03:27,460
Everywhere!

1640
02:03:27,920 --> 02:03:28,920
Shuriken!

1641
02:03:30,740 --> 02:03:32,820
My body hasn't recovered yet.

1642
02:03:32,980 --> 02:03:35,160
I have to use the sand to defend!

1643
02:03:40,940 --> 02:03:41,840
Naruto!

1644
02:03:41,880 --> 02:03:42,880
Naruto!

1645
02:03:42,980 --> 02:03:43,980
Two Kills!

1646
02:03:44,080 --> 02:03:45,600
Uzumaki Barrage!

1647
02:03:59,820 --> 02:04:01,200
Naruto's Handbook!

1648
02:04:08,320 --> 02:04:13,380
Kid... This time we'll use both
legs for a barrage of 4,000 Kicks!

1649
02:04:14,115 --> 02:04:16,640
Where did that strength come from?

1650
02:04:16,641 --> 02:04:21,140
There's no way... Not to him!

1651
02:04:23,300 --> 02:04:28,720
There's absolutely no way I'm gonna lose
to a guy like him!

1652
02:04:40,710 --> 02:04:43,440
What the... What is that?

1653
02:04:50,000 --> 02:04:53,320
So... He's finally emerged...

1654
02:05:09,460 --> 02:05:11,940
The perfect possession...

1655
02:05:15,440 --> 02:05:16,700
So that's it!

1656
02:05:16,701 --> 02:05:20,060
The monster... Inside of him!

1657
02:05:24,500 --> 02:05:25,500
Naruto!

1658
02:05:28,660 --> 02:05:34,800
My... body... I used up all my
Chakra... on all those clones!

1659
02:05:40,910 --> 02:05:41,880
Sakura!

1660
02:05:41,881 --> 02:05:42,881
Sakura!

1661
02:05:46,380 --> 02:05:49,300
This is the end for you...

1662
02:05:49,805 --> 02:05:50,880
SANBURU!

1663
02:05:51,100 --> 02:05:51,540
Kamari!

1664
02:05:51,620 --> 02:05:52,620
Jujutsu!

1665
02:05:59,580 --> 02:06:00,580
Sakura!

1666
02:06:02,520 --> 02:06:04,860
I swear I'll protect you!

1667
02:06:05,760 --> 02:06:11,640
I swear I'll protect you!

1668
02:06:11,800 --> 02:06:11,860
I swear I'll protect you!

1669
02:06:11,861 --> 02:06:12,861
Uzumaki...

1670
02:06:15,565 --> 02:06:19,840
You really are good at amusing me...

1671
02:06:20,780 --> 02:06:24,180
Naruto... How on
Earth can you do that?

1672
02:06:25,350 --> 02:06:26,540
Not you again!

1673
02:06:26,940 --> 02:06:28,380
What is this?

1674
02:06:29,040 --> 02:06:30,040
Huh?

1675
02:06:30,710 --> 02:06:32,680
Well, will you look at that?

1676
02:06:33,720 --> 02:06:35,400
Shukaku the Sand Spirit!

1677
02:06:36,080 --> 02:06:37,080
What do you say?

1678
02:06:37,765 --> 02:06:39,800
Will you fight alongside me today,
Chief Toad?

1679
02:06:44,400 --> 02:06:45,590
Take a hike...

1680
02:06:46,950 --> 02:06:50,690
Why go out of my way to mess with a guy
like him?

1681
02:06:51,540 --> 02:06:52,650
What am I, an idiot?

1682
02:06:53,070 --> 02:06:53,270
Why?

1683
02:06:53,470 --> 02:06:54,510
Are you kidding me?

1684
02:06:54,630 --> 02:06:57,250
You already told me you would make me your
henchman, didn't you?

1685
02:06:57,760 --> 02:07:00,710
It's only natural a boss would want to
help out his henchman, isn't it?

1686
02:07:01,215 --> 02:07:02,710
Don't you have any sense of duty?

1687
02:07:03,570 --> 02:07:04,570
Yeah, sure.

1688
02:07:04,790 --> 02:07:07,510
I told you I'd make you my henchman.

1689
02:07:08,095 --> 02:07:11,630
But we haven't even sealed the deal over a
couple of weeks.

1690
02:07:13,710 --> 02:07:16,030
I'm not even 21 years old yet!

1691
02:07:16,110 --> 02:07:17,410
I can't have any alcohol!

1692
02:07:18,670 --> 02:07:19,670
Come on, Pops.

1693
02:07:19,730 --> 02:07:20,370
Don't be like that.

1694
02:07:20,450 --> 02:07:22,386
Why don't you just settle down and hear
the kid out?

1695
02:07:22,410 --> 02:07:22,670
Huh?

1696
02:07:23,270 --> 02:07:24,270
Pops?

1697
02:07:24,670 --> 02:07:27,730
And just what do you think you're doing
here, Gamakichi?

1698
02:07:28,130 --> 02:07:29,410
I had nothing else to do.

1699
02:07:29,550 --> 02:07:31,250
I just came to hang out.

1700
02:07:31,450 --> 02:07:31,670
Huh?

1701
02:07:31,790 --> 02:07:32,230
Huh?

1702
02:07:32,695 --> 02:07:33,695
Your father and son?

1703
02:07:34,410 --> 02:07:37,310
By the way, Pops, that big ugly lug over
there was picking on me before.

1704
02:07:38,435 --> 02:07:39,435
Come again?

1705
02:07:41,240 --> 02:07:43,890
Oh yeah, and when he did, our friend here
came to my rescue.

1706
02:07:44,760 --> 02:07:46,880
He went head to head and toe to toe with
that monster.

1707
02:07:47,190 --> 02:07:50,470
I'm telling you, Pops, there's a heck of a
lot more to this kid than meets the eye.

1708
02:07:51,710 --> 02:07:52,970
Is that right?

1709
02:07:54,870 --> 02:07:55,870
Okay, kid.

1710
02:07:56,530 --> 02:07:59,310
You're hereby accepted as my henchman.

1711
02:07:59,950 --> 02:08:00,950
Sit tight.

1712
02:08:01,750 --> 02:08:04,570
I'll show you what duty is all about.

1713
02:08:05,910 --> 02:08:06,350
Whoa!

1714
02:08:06,351 --> 02:08:09,890
Hang on, kitesmoke, right?

1715
02:08:11,970 --> 02:08:14,410
Don't you like that?

1716
02:08:15,190 --> 02:08:16,390
Whoa!

1717
02:08:19,890 --> 02:08:21,290
Awesome!

1718
02:08:38,280 --> 02:08:39,600
This guy's no joke.

1719
02:08:40,140 --> 02:08:43,340
I barely managed to make that cutty so
heavy.

1720
02:08:43,740 --> 02:08:48,640
If I don't end this quick, the landscape's
gonna start changing around here.

1721
02:08:48,920 --> 02:08:49,460
Hey, Chief!

1722
02:08:49,620 --> 02:08:50,620
Hold on a second!

1723
02:08:51,195 --> 02:08:52,475
Don't go over in that direction!

1724
02:08:52,660 --> 02:08:53,660
Sakura's still there!

1725
02:08:53,855 --> 02:08:56,260
Try and lure him over this way if you can,
okay?

1726
02:08:57,119 --> 02:08:58,119
Sakura?

1727
02:08:59,270 --> 02:09:00,550
It's his little girlfriend, Pop.

1728
02:09:00,820 --> 02:09:01,820
Right, kid?

1729
02:09:02,255 --> 02:09:03,460
I have to take him out!

1730
02:09:04,280 --> 02:09:06,400
Otherwise, Sakura's as good as dead!

1731
02:09:07,680 --> 02:09:08,680
Hm-hm-hm.

1732
02:09:12,320 --> 02:09:13,396
Interesting... INTERESTING!

1733
02:09:13,420 --> 02:09:15,780
NOT BAD, MARUTOZO-MAKI!

1734
02:09:16,920 --> 02:09:18,020
This isn't good!

1735
02:09:18,580 --> 02:09:19,060
Kana!

1736
02:09:19,460 --> 02:09:20,780
He's really going to do it!

1737
02:09:20,960 --> 02:09:22,180
I have to get out of here!

1738
02:09:42,310 --> 02:09:43,450
He's done it.

1739
02:09:45,320 --> 02:09:46,910
I don't like this at all, Chief Toad.

1740
02:09:47,030 --> 02:09:47,890
What's gonna happen?

1741
02:09:48,050 --> 02:09:48,330
I don't like this at all, Chief Toad.

1742
02:09:48,330 --> 02:09:48,330
What's gonna happen?

1743
02:09:48,800 --> 02:09:56,571
If he's set the Play Possum Jutsu in
motion, then the Shikaku will be unleashed!

1744
02:10:01,390 --> 02:10:03,010
I'm finally free!

1745
02:10:03,510 --> 02:10:04,910
Here I come, baby!

1746
02:10:08,090 --> 02:10:09,110
Here we go!

1747
02:10:09,490 --> 02:10:11,190
I hope you're ready to die!

1748
02:10:11,490 --> 02:10:12,630
Let's do this!

1749
02:10:14,090 --> 02:10:15,670
I'm gonna jump!

1750
02:10:16,030 --> 02:10:16,210
Huh?

1751
02:10:16,470 --> 02:10:17,470
Wind style!

1752
02:10:18,350 --> 02:10:19,410
Air bullets!

1753
02:10:22,170 --> 02:10:23,170
Water style!

1754
02:10:23,510 --> 02:10:24,510
Liquid bullets!

1755
02:10:33,750 --> 02:10:35,230
Oh, this is nice.

1756
02:10:35,510 --> 02:10:36,930
I didn't know it was gonna rain.

1757
02:10:37,370 --> 02:10:39,910
What kind of a battle is this turning
into?

1758
02:10:43,290 --> 02:10:44,290
Remember, Chief!

1759
02:10:44,370 --> 02:10:45,370
Not in that direction!

1760
02:10:45,670 --> 02:10:46,830
Will you shut up?

1761
02:10:46,890 --> 02:10:47,910
I know already!

1762
02:10:47,911 --> 02:10:48,911
Ready!

1763
02:10:49,830 --> 02:10:51,070
Air bullets!

1764
02:10:52,250 --> 02:10:53,630
Liquid bullets!

1765
02:10:56,950 --> 02:10:58,590
Too bad.

1766
02:10:59,070 --> 02:11:00,090
This is bad, Chief!

1767
02:11:00,350 --> 02:11:01,410
There's one more coming!

1768
02:11:02,190 --> 02:11:03,190
Ugh!

1769
02:11:09,250 --> 02:11:11,170
I did it!

1770
02:11:11,171 --> 02:11:12,190
I killed him!

1771
02:11:12,350 --> 02:11:13,690
I killed him!

1772
02:11:14,090 --> 02:11:16,090
I did it!

1773
02:11:17,070 --> 02:11:17,170
I killed him!

1774
02:11:17,170 --> 02:11:17,170
I killed him!

1775
02:11:17,171 --> 02:11:19,270
Now that kind of hurt.

1776
02:11:19,890 --> 02:11:24,390
That was an awful lot of chakra that you
blasted me with, I have to admit.

1777
02:11:24,970 --> 02:11:29,330
Hit me with a couple more of those,
even I won't last much longer.

1778
02:11:29,630 --> 02:11:30,670
Chief, what should we do?

1779
02:11:31,090 --> 02:11:37,330
Well, for starters, you can wake up the
spiritualist medium to release that jutsu.

1780
02:11:37,590 --> 02:11:39,250
How am I supposed to do that?

1781
02:11:39,550 --> 02:11:41,910
Just fire off a few rounds at him!

1782
02:11:43,450 --> 02:11:44,550
Liquid bullets!

1783
02:11:45,650 --> 02:11:46,650
You missed!

1784
02:11:51,410 --> 02:11:54,130
Hey, Chief!

1785
02:11:54,330 --> 02:11:57,450
You're gonna have to keep a grip on him if
you want me to get a shot at him!

1786
02:11:58,650 --> 02:12:03,450
My body doesn't have any claws or horns to
dig into the enemy with!

1787
02:12:04,930 --> 02:12:06,850
Then what the heck are we supposed to do?

1788
02:12:07,370 --> 02:12:11,650
Use the transformation jutsu to change
into something that has what we need!

1789
02:12:13,190 --> 02:12:14,190
Then again...

1790
02:12:14,550 --> 02:12:16,890
I'm not particularly good at
transformations.

1791
02:12:17,610 --> 02:12:17,750
Huh?

1792
02:12:18,130 --> 02:12:19,810
Don't worry about it!

1793
02:12:19,930 --> 02:12:22,870
You shall act upon my will and make a hand
sign!

1794
02:12:23,330 --> 02:12:23,750
What?

1795
02:12:24,250 --> 02:12:26,150
A combined transformation!

1796
02:12:27,070 --> 02:12:28,070
Uh, okay!

1797
02:12:28,590 --> 02:12:31,170
Conjure up something with fangs and claws!

1798
02:12:31,910 --> 02:12:32,510
Let's see!

1799
02:12:32,790 --> 02:12:35,050
Uh... Here we go!

1800
02:12:36,190 --> 02:12:36,830
Hey!

1801
02:12:37,090 --> 02:12:37,410
Hey!

1802
02:12:37,530 --> 02:12:37,750
Hey!

1803
02:12:37,930 --> 02:12:38,930
Wait a second!

1804
02:12:39,250 --> 02:12:40,250
Fangs and claws!

1805
02:12:40,370 --> 02:12:41,050
Fangs and claws!

1806
02:12:41,330 --> 02:12:41,990
Fangs and claws!

1807
02:12:42,310 --> 02:12:43,310
Yeah!

1808
02:12:44,550 --> 02:12:45,550
Transform!

1809
02:12:54,470 --> 02:12:56,450
That's the...

1810
02:13:03,370 --> 02:13:08,210
Okay, kids!

1811
02:13:08,230 --> 02:13:08,750
You're on!

1812
02:13:09,150 --> 02:13:10,690
Let's do it!

1813
02:13:10,691 --> 02:13:12,750
Let's do it!

1814
02:13:13,470 --> 02:13:14,710
Rise and shine!

1815
02:13:20,370 --> 02:13:21,430
How's that?

1816
02:13:22,370 --> 02:13:23,130
Good.

1817
02:13:23,270 --> 02:13:26,390
Not much time has passed since the meteor
went under.

1818
02:13:26,610 --> 02:13:29,030
That one blow should have done the trick!

1819
02:13:29,770 --> 02:13:32,490
Aw, that's just great!

1820
02:13:34,390 --> 02:13:35,630
Give me a break!

1821
02:13:35,750 --> 02:13:37,190
I just got here!

1822
02:13:39,730 --> 02:13:51,190
No, it's alright!

1823
02:13:51,191 --> 02:13:52,191
Huh?

1824
02:13:53,790 --> 02:13:54,790
What's that?

1825
02:13:55,050 --> 02:13:55,330
What's that, anyway?

1826
02:13:55,331 --> 02:13:56,331
The one on the top!

1827
02:13:57,030 --> 02:14:00,510
You... You think
that's my fault?

1828
02:14:00,930 --> 02:14:02,891
Uh... Uh...

1829
02:14:05,850 --> 02:14:10,350
Well, who do you think you are?

1830
02:14:11,410 --> 02:14:12,410
Damn!

1831
02:14:12,970 --> 02:14:15,690
How much strength does this guy have left?

1832
02:14:16,830 --> 02:14:18,170
This ain't good.

1833
02:14:18,630 --> 02:14:21,970
Naruto and I have already used up all of
our chakra.

1834
02:14:25,870 --> 02:14:28,310
I'll wipe you from the face of the Earth.

1835
02:14:28,510 --> 02:14:30,630
I will not cease to exist!

1836
02:14:40,350 --> 02:14:41,570
I will not cease to exist!

1837
02:14:43,910 --> 02:14:45,430
Ha ha!

1838
02:14:46,810 --> 02:14:47,870
Ha ha!

1839
02:14:47,871 --> 02:14:48,871
Twenty!

1840
02:14:56,160 --> 02:14:57,170
Twenty-one!

1841
02:15:19,350 --> 02:15:21,670
Kakashi, how many did you take down?

1842
02:15:21,930 --> 02:15:22,930
Twenty-two.

1843
02:15:24,010 --> 02:15:26,410
Looks like I win another round,
huh buddy?

1844
02:15:28,530 --> 02:15:31,190
That last one I knocked off was my
twenty-third.

1845
02:15:31,390 --> 02:15:32,390
Yeah, yeah, alright.

1846
02:15:32,890 --> 02:15:35,850
I love that two-couple-for-school attitude
of yours.

1847
02:15:36,230 --> 02:15:38,150
That's why you're my number one rival.

1848
02:15:38,151 --> 02:15:38,790
Hehe.

1849
02:15:39,110 --> 02:15:39,870
Let's go.

1850
02:15:40,070 --> 02:15:41,070
Alright!

1851
02:15:50,430 --> 02:15:52,770
He still has my arms!

1852
02:15:53,210 --> 02:16:00,370
Can't use an achu so-Don't you think it's
about time you took a rest, old man?

1853
02:16:09,790 --> 02:16:13,050
I won't let this village-Stop.

1854
02:16:13,070 --> 02:16:15,230
Are we swallowed up by your ambition?

1855
02:16:15,970 --> 02:16:18,170
Nothing can stop my ambition.

1856
02:16:18,530 --> 02:16:21,030
You are going to die here.

1857
02:16:21,850 --> 02:16:24,030
I don't care if you are Third Hokage.

1858
02:16:24,310 --> 02:16:26,590
You're nothing but a withered old fool.

1859
02:16:26,950 --> 02:16:30,350
Do you honestly believe you have the
strength needed to stop me now?

1860
02:16:31,990 --> 02:16:37,209
Have you even the slightest idea what's
befalling your precious little village?

1861
02:16:37,770 --> 02:16:41,730
Do not underestimate the shinobi of this
village.

1862
02:16:48,379 --> 02:16:49,379
No!

1863
02:16:52,200 --> 02:16:54,200
Not another step!

1864
02:16:54,520 --> 02:16:56,180
You are done here!

1865
02:17:10,790 --> 02:17:11,590
No!

1866
02:17:11,591 --> 02:17:12,591
Sakura!

1867
02:17:13,450 --> 02:17:17,910
You have to save Sakura if it's the last
thing you do.

1868
02:17:18,090 --> 02:17:19,090
Sakura!

1869
02:17:19,190 --> 02:17:20,870
I swear on you!

1870
02:17:20,889 --> 02:17:21,889
I'll protect you!

1871
02:17:22,280 --> 02:17:23,280
Come on!

1872
02:17:28,514 --> 02:17:29,514
I don't need much.

1873
02:17:29,549 --> 02:17:31,240
Just give me...

1874
02:17:37,030 --> 02:17:38,379
Give me some chakra!

1875
02:17:41,809 --> 02:17:42,809
No!

1876
02:17:46,030 --> 02:17:47,030
No!

1877
02:17:47,580 --> 02:17:48,580
No!

1878
02:17:49,650 --> 02:17:50,650
No!

1879
02:18:01,959 --> 02:18:06,040
What are you all waiting for?

1880
02:18:06,160 --> 02:18:07,280
It's just one man!

1881
02:18:18,600 --> 02:18:21,620
The Leaf Village's spirit is strong.

1882
02:18:21,959 --> 02:18:23,540
You do well to remember.

1883
02:18:25,520 --> 02:18:27,740
My... my body!

1884
02:18:28,260 --> 02:18:29,780
I can't move!

1885
02:18:32,400 --> 02:18:33,920
Come on, fellas.

1886
02:18:34,280 --> 02:18:37,480
You've never heard of the Shadow Paralysis
Jutsu?

1887
02:18:37,660 --> 02:18:40,000
Then you're gonna love this next one.

1888
02:18:40,719 --> 02:18:44,940
The Leaf Village's Shadow Strangle Jutsu.

1889
02:18:46,540 --> 02:18:47,540
Aaaaaah!

1890
02:18:49,820 --> 02:18:51,280
Expansion Jutsu!

1891
02:18:51,281 --> 02:18:52,980
Gaaaaaah!

1892
02:18:56,299 --> 02:18:57,700
What?!

1893
02:18:57,701 --> 02:19:00,139
Mind Destruction Jutsu!

1894
02:19:04,280 --> 02:19:06,500
Wh... what are you doing?

1895
02:19:07,700 --> 02:19:09,700
Stop it!

1896
02:19:09,780 --> 02:19:10,780
Stop!

1897
02:19:11,160 --> 02:19:12,180
Aaaah!

1898
02:19:15,719 --> 02:19:16,719
Mmm...

1899
02:19:18,840 --> 02:19:21,080
Reminds you of the good old days,
doesn't it?

1900
02:19:21,180 --> 02:19:22,299
You bet it does.

1901
02:19:22,600 --> 02:19:25,660
The Inoshika-cho trio is back.

1902
02:19:27,900 --> 02:19:32,639
Let's go, Kuramaru!

1903
02:19:32,820 --> 02:19:33,820
Right.

1904
02:19:34,760 --> 02:19:38,420
Never mind the odds our Leaf Shinobi are
up against.

1905
02:19:38,799 --> 02:19:41,080
They'll lay down their lives for this
village.

1906
02:19:42,639 --> 02:19:45,000
How little you understand.

1907
02:19:46,059 --> 02:19:50,280
Mastering every jutsu will not give you
unsurpassable strength.

1908
02:19:52,240 --> 02:19:57,120
The poison in my body
is... Try not to move, Shino.

1909
02:19:57,280 --> 02:19:58,980
I've injected my parasites.

1910
02:19:59,380 --> 02:20:01,140
They're neutralizing the poison.

1911
02:20:02,460 --> 02:20:03,460
Dad...

1912
02:20:04,760 --> 02:20:07,660
It was one of my first lessons.

1913
02:20:08,020 --> 02:20:11,060
It's not until you've protected someone
precious...

1914
02:20:11,080 --> 02:20:14,400
that the true strength of the Shinobi can
emerge!

1915
02:20:18,160 --> 02:20:21,280
I am going to protect everyone!

1916
02:20:25,890 --> 02:20:27,760
Get ready, you creepy monster!

1917
02:20:37,140 --> 02:20:39,340
I've had it with you!

1918
02:21:07,950 --> 02:21:09,530
Did... did he win?

1919
02:21:10,210 --> 02:21:12,290
A plain old headbutt, huh?

1920
02:21:12,970 --> 02:21:16,030
Well, he's not the most elegant fighter
I've ever seen.

1921
02:21:16,350 --> 02:21:20,530
But to dredge up the chakra he needed,
worn out as he was...

1922
02:21:20,531 --> 02:21:23,570
He might be the biggest knucklehead I've
ever come across.

1923
02:21:23,930 --> 02:21:27,710
But I haven't seen a kid with this much
promise in ages.

1924
02:21:28,550 --> 02:21:31,750
Wish I could stick around to see how this
ends.

1925
02:21:32,230 --> 02:21:34,510
But I've reached my limit, too.

1926
02:21:35,970 --> 02:21:36,570
Gamakichi!

1927
02:21:36,571 --> 02:21:38,370
It's time we went back!

1928
02:21:38,530 --> 02:21:39,530
Okay, Pops.

1929
02:21:39,710 --> 02:21:40,710
Let's do it.

1930
02:21:56,730 --> 02:21:57,210
That's it.

1931
02:21:57,290 --> 02:21:58,290
I can't go any further.

1932
02:21:58,865 --> 02:22:00,550
I've used up all my chakra.

1933
02:22:01,859 --> 02:22:04,330
And from the look of you, so have you.

1934
02:22:04,890 --> 02:22:06,630
You and I are a lot alike.

1935
02:22:07,359 --> 02:22:08,290
More than you know.

1936
02:22:08,291 --> 02:22:10,510
We shouldn't be doing this.

1937
02:22:13,870 --> 02:22:15,450
All right, then.

1938
02:22:15,730 --> 02:22:18,143
You and I both know
I haven't the strength

1939
02:22:18,144 --> 02:22:20,470
left to rip all of your
soul from its shell.

1940
02:22:20,650 --> 02:22:22,890
You and I both know that.

1941
02:22:23,830 --> 02:22:27,630
And yet, your ambitions end here and now.

1942
02:22:27,970 --> 02:22:28,970
This isn't over!

1943
02:22:29,110 --> 02:22:31,670
There isn't any stopping my ambition!

1944
02:22:32,190 --> 02:22:33,590
Yours is an obsession.

1945
02:22:33,810 --> 02:22:36,590
This need to drown yourself in jutsu.

1946
02:22:36,591 --> 02:22:39,310
And for this transgression, you shall be
punished.

1947
02:22:39,650 --> 02:22:42,930
I shall take away all the jutsu you hold
so dear.

1948
02:22:43,290 --> 02:22:44,330
What did you say?

1949
02:22:51,390 --> 02:22:52,390
Impossible!

1950
02:22:54,990 --> 02:22:56,510
You wouldn't dare!

1951
02:22:59,710 --> 02:23:01,430
The seal is set!

1952
02:23:11,510 --> 02:23:13,770
My... my arms!

1953
02:23:16,430 --> 02:23:17,870
There you have it.

1954
02:23:17,990 --> 02:23:20,370
Your arms are useless to you now.

1955
02:23:20,690 --> 02:23:24,490
And without those arms, you will never
form another hand side.

1956
02:23:25,130 --> 02:23:27,690
Ninjutsu is forever out of your reach!

1957
02:23:28,450 --> 02:23:30,290
You feeble old man!

1958
02:23:30,770 --> 02:23:32,950
Give me back my arms!

1959
02:23:33,390 --> 02:23:36,490
Your foolishness is unparalleled,
Orochimaru.

1960
02:23:36,491 --> 02:23:40,350
My one regret is that I couldn't take you
with me.

1961
02:23:40,790 --> 02:23:42,010
Farewell, disciple.

1962
02:23:42,470 --> 02:23:45,210
May we meet again in the next world.

1963
02:23:46,130 --> 02:23:48,230
You decrepit old man!

1964
02:23:48,570 --> 02:23:49,990
How dare you!

1965
02:23:50,090 --> 02:23:52,490
How dare you take my jutsu from me!

1966
02:24:05,500 --> 02:24:09,580
Where the tree leaves dance, one shall
find flames.

1967
02:24:10,460 --> 02:24:14,100
The fire's shadow will illuminate the
village.

1968
02:24:26,980 --> 02:24:31,870
The fire's shadow will illuminate the
village.

1969
02:24:31,871 --> 02:24:35,650
And once again, tree leaves shall bud
anew.

1970
02:24:56,830 --> 02:25:01,140
And once again, tree leaves shall bud
anew.

1971
02:25:01,141 --> 02:25:02,141
Sarutobi!

1972
02:25:03,900 --> 02:25:06,400
Let me remove the blade.

1973
02:25:09,520 --> 02:25:15,140
A fitting end for one who had mastered the
way of the shinobi.

1974
02:25:15,740 --> 02:25:20,360
A fitting end for one who had mastered the
way of the shinobi.

1975
02:25:21,640 --> 02:25:25,460
My arms... feel as if they're on fire!

1976
02:25:25,700 --> 02:25:26,700
Lord Orochimaru!

1977
02:25:27,300 --> 02:25:29,240
Our mission has failed.

1978
02:25:30,120 --> 02:25:31,700
Release the barrier.

1979
02:25:32,120 --> 02:25:33,360
Take me back!

1980
02:25:33,700 --> 02:25:34,100
Right!

1981
02:25:34,440 --> 02:25:35,440
Release!

1982
02:25:43,240 --> 02:25:44,240
Stop them!

1983
02:25:45,600 --> 02:25:46,640
Ninja heart!

1984
02:25:47,060 --> 02:25:48,280
Spider web neck!

1985
02:25:48,540 --> 02:25:49,340
Watch out!

1986
02:25:49,341 --> 02:25:50,940
A chakra web!

1987
02:25:51,080 --> 02:25:52,620
And we flew right into it!

1988
02:25:54,800 --> 02:25:55,320
Kakashi!

1989
02:25:55,669 --> 02:25:56,669
They're pulling out!

1990
02:25:56,700 --> 02:25:57,740
We should go after them!

1991
02:25:57,880 --> 02:25:58,880
Wait, guy.

1992
02:25:58,949 --> 02:25:59,949
I'm not so sure.

1993
02:26:00,180 --> 02:26:01,180
That's right.

1994
02:26:01,889 --> 02:26:03,400
Let's not be too hasty.

1995
02:26:03,769 --> 02:26:06,160
If we rush in, we might get snared in
their traps.

1996
02:26:08,080 --> 02:26:12,360
So... you propose that we do nothing,
eh, Kabuto?

1997
02:26:15,780 --> 02:26:17,720
Well, aren't you the clever one.

1998
02:26:19,300 --> 02:26:20,820
Time to call it a day.

1999
02:26:21,540 --> 02:26:23,720
Are you gonna run away from me again?

2000
02:26:24,239 --> 02:26:26,020
That would be too obvious.

2001
02:26:26,360 --> 02:26:30,740
Why should I show my hand when it's so
much more fun keeping you in the dark?

2002
02:26:31,420 --> 02:26:34,720
That eye of yours can't see everything,
can it?

2003
02:26:35,000 --> 02:26:38,200
Unlike the Uchiha clan, you haven't
mastered it yet.

2004
02:26:38,940 --> 02:26:39,940
Oh well.

2005
02:26:51,250 --> 02:26:52,250
Tamari...

2006
02:26:57,650 --> 02:26:58,650
Kankuro!

2007
02:27:17,719 --> 02:27:18,719
I'll leave her with you.

2008
02:27:19,700 --> 02:27:22,005
What could it be.

2009
02:27:32,865 --> 02:27:35,080
.. that makes him so strong?

2010
02:27:49,780 --> 02:27:51,340
What are you doing?

2011
02:27:51,540 --> 02:27:53,120
I told you not to talk to him!

2012
02:27:53,480 --> 02:27:54,480
Let's get out of here!

2013
02:27:58,860 --> 02:27:59,700
Watch out!

2014
02:27:59,880 --> 02:28:02,060
It's... it's him again!

2015
02:28:03,520 --> 02:28:05,200
Why don't you just go away?

2016
02:28:05,780 --> 02:28:08,540
Go away, you... you freak!

2017
02:28:09,300 --> 02:28:09,900
Freak!

2018
02:28:09,901 --> 02:28:10,901
Freak!

2019
02:28:23,600 --> 02:28:24,200
Freak!

2020
02:28:24,201 --> 02:28:25,480
Why don't you die?

2021
02:28:28,140 --> 02:28:29,220
He's a monster!

2022
02:28:29,520 --> 02:28:31,140
Don't even look at him!

2023
02:28:33,480 --> 02:28:35,520
I told you to stay away from him!

2024
02:28:38,600 --> 02:28:39,660
Go away!

2025
02:29:04,820 --> 02:29:07,160
It's all a distant memory now.

2026
02:29:07,960 --> 02:29:11,140
Why do I exist, I used to ask myself.

2027
02:29:11,680 --> 02:29:13,260
And then I found out.

2028
02:29:16,040 --> 02:29:18,140
But I knew that something else was going
to happen.

2029
02:29:18,141 --> 02:29:19,661
Something else had been taken from me.

2030
02:29:19,740 --> 02:29:21,680
Something even more important.

2031
02:29:22,280 --> 02:29:24,700
And that is when I truly despaired.

2032
02:29:25,320 --> 02:29:26,400
My purpose?

2033
02:29:26,740 --> 02:29:30,120
In all the world, there was no one who
needed me.

2034
02:29:30,280 --> 02:29:32,120
I was... unnecessary.

2035
02:29:34,580 --> 02:29:35,180
No!

2036
02:29:35,181 --> 02:29:36,220
Stay away!

2037
02:29:44,240 --> 02:29:47,020
It's almost unbearable, isn't it?

2038
02:29:48,740 --> 02:29:51,100
The feeling of being all alone.

2039
02:29:54,020 --> 02:29:55,760
I know that feeling.

2040
02:29:56,580 --> 02:29:57,700
I've been there.

2041
02:29:57,900 --> 02:30:00,240
In that dark and lonely place.

2042
02:30:00,920 --> 02:30:02,980
But now there are others.

2043
02:30:03,900 --> 02:30:06,060
Other people who mean a lot to me.

2044
02:30:08,720 --> 02:30:11,660
I care more about them than I do myself.

2045
02:30:12,380 --> 02:30:14,660
And I won't let anyone hurt them.

2046
02:30:15,380 --> 02:30:17,440
That's why I won't ever give up.

2047
02:30:18,140 --> 02:30:19,520
I will stop you.

2048
02:30:19,880 --> 02:30:21,880
Even if I have to kill you!

2049
02:30:22,660 --> 02:30:23,740
But why?

2050
02:30:24,780 --> 02:30:27,660
Why would you do this for anyone but
yourself?

2051
02:30:28,460 --> 02:30:31,060
Because they saved me from myself.

2052
02:30:31,480 --> 02:30:33,800
They rescued me from my loneliness.

2053
02:30:34,140 --> 02:30:37,480
They were the first to accept me for who I
am.

2054
02:30:39,579 --> 02:30:40,760
They're my friends.

2055
02:30:41,620 --> 02:30:42,620
...

2056
02:30:46,520 --> 02:30:52,380
Well, love is... the heart's desire to
serve someone who is precious to you.

2057
02:30:52,480 --> 02:30:55,060
To watch over them, like my sister did.

2058
02:30:55,720 --> 02:30:56,860
For you, Gaara.

2059
02:30:58,960 --> 02:31:02,820
Love... is that the thing that makes him
so strong?

2060
02:31:04,440 --> 02:31:06,000
Naruto, that's enough.

2061
02:31:11,209 --> 02:31:12,820
Look, Sakura's gonna be alright.

2062
02:31:14,109 --> 02:31:15,900
The sand crumbled away, she's free.

2063
02:31:17,469 --> 02:31:19,380
This guy's chakra is all used up.

2064
02:31:20,900 --> 02:31:21,900
That's a relief.

2065
02:31:28,880 --> 02:31:29,880
That's enough.

2066
02:31:31,180 --> 02:31:32,180
It's over.

2067
02:31:32,759 --> 02:31:36,540
But Gaara... I never thought I'd see this.

2068
02:31:37,839 --> 02:31:38,839
He's had it.

2069
02:31:39,559 --> 02:31:41,060
Alright, Gaara.

2070
02:31:56,300 --> 02:31:57,590
Who

2071
02:32:01,720 --> 02:32:09,720
knows, Naruto Uzumaki... Perhaps even I,
someday...

2072
02:32:13,520 --> 02:32:17,001
Tamari... Konkoro... Hm?

2073
02:32:17,720 --> 02:32:18,720
I'm sorry.

2074
02:32:18,960 --> 02:32:19,960
Huh?

2075
02:32:23,140 --> 02:32:24,780
Don't worry about it.

2076
02:33:30,470 --> 02:33:31,470
It's raining.

2077
02:33:32,630 --> 02:33:34,450
Even the heavens weep.

2078
02:33:36,670 --> 02:33:42,690
We are gathered here to remember and honor
not only the third Hokage, but all those

2079
02:33:42,691 --> 02:33:47,410
who sacrificed themselves in this battle
so that our village would survive.

2080
02:34:05,610 --> 02:34:07,550
Why did it have to happen?

2081
02:34:08,630 --> 02:34:11,630
Why did someone so good have to die?

2082
02:34:12,170 --> 02:34:13,170
Why?

2083
02:34:45,040 --> 02:34:46,560
Are those for Hayate?

2084
02:34:51,920 --> 02:34:53,220
Better make it quick.

2085
02:34:53,400 --> 02:34:55,620
The Hokage's funeral has already begun.

2086
02:34:57,220 --> 02:34:58,640
And you, Kakashi?

2087
02:34:59,480 --> 02:35:00,920
Paying respects to Obito?

2088
02:35:01,840 --> 02:35:04,731
Instead of constantly
inventing new excuses for

2089
02:35:04,732 --> 02:35:07,180
being late, why don't you
simply come here earlier?

2090
02:35:10,500 --> 02:35:11,500
I did.

2091
02:35:12,000 --> 02:35:13,700
I've been here since dawn.

2092
02:35:17,459 --> 02:35:21,100
This place makes me think of the mistakes
I've made in the past.

2093
02:35:22,079 --> 02:35:23,560
And I've made so many of them.

2094
02:35:30,690 --> 02:35:32,090
There are two bells.

2095
02:35:32,670 --> 02:35:34,470
And since there are only two...

2096
02:35:34,990 --> 02:35:36,690
One of us will get tied to the stump.

2097
02:35:36,850 --> 02:35:36,950
Huh?

2098
02:35:36,951 --> 02:35:39,670
You're pretty quick on the uptake,
Orochimaru.

2099
02:35:40,010 --> 02:35:41,010
All right!

2100
02:35:41,190 --> 02:35:42,290
I got this one in the bag!

2101
02:35:43,650 --> 02:35:46,190
I want you to come at me with the intent
to kill.

2102
02:35:58,730 --> 02:36:01,510
Well, Jiraiya, looks like I win our little
wager.

2103
02:36:02,090 --> 02:36:03,750
Enjoy your time on the stump.

2104
02:36:04,170 --> 02:36:06,910
Ah, just shut up, you flat-chested cunt!

2105
02:36:06,911 --> 02:36:09,010
What did you say?

2106
02:36:09,210 --> 02:36:11,110
You annoying little perv!

2107
02:36:12,110 --> 02:36:13,490
Okay, that's enough.

2108
02:36:13,750 --> 02:36:14,990
Enough, Tsunade.

2109
02:36:15,110 --> 02:36:17,030
You and Orochimaru head home.

2110
02:36:29,710 --> 02:36:31,830
You're unbelievable, you know that?

2111
02:36:32,070 --> 02:36:33,730
How can you be a ninja?

2112
02:36:33,731 --> 02:36:37,010
You keep falling for the same obvious
traps over and over again.

2113
02:36:37,190 --> 02:36:40,290
Yeah, but... You could learn a
few things from Orochimaru.

2114
02:36:41,170 --> 02:36:43,430
It's always the same thing with you,
Sensei.

2115
02:36:43,550 --> 02:36:45,270
Orochimaru this and Orochimaru that.

2116
02:36:46,610 --> 02:36:50,570
The transparency jutsu I use is flawless
when I'm out researching.

2117
02:36:51,810 --> 02:36:52,670
Oh, boy.

2118
02:36:52,770 --> 02:36:55,730
I'm not even sure I want to know where you
are with transparency.

2119
02:36:55,930 --> 02:36:58,030
I haven't been caught peeping yet.

2120
02:36:58,130 --> 02:36:59,510
It's true, I swear.

2121
02:37:01,170 --> 02:37:03,390
Alright then, if you're so sure of
yourself.

2122
02:37:04,130 --> 02:37:06,150
I'll, uh, have to tag along next time.

2123
02:37:10,220 --> 02:37:12,490
Wow, Sarutobi-sensei, you're a perv.

2124
02:37:27,280 --> 02:37:28,320
Iruka-sensei...

2125
02:37:30,340 --> 02:37:31,700
Why do they do it?

2126
02:37:32,080 --> 02:37:34,900
Why do people risk their lives for other
people?

2127
02:37:37,940 --> 02:37:41,980
Well, when someone passes away,
it's the end.

2128
02:37:43,340 --> 02:37:50,280
His past and future, all the dreams he
once had, they disappear along with him.

2129
02:37:50,880 --> 02:37:55,960
This is true even if he dies honorably in
battle, as so many have.

2130
02:37:57,080 --> 02:37:58,440
As Hayate did.

2131
02:38:00,960 --> 02:38:04,280
All the ties that bind him to the living
are severed.

2132
02:38:04,900 --> 02:38:07,600
All but one, the most important of all.

2133
02:38:08,600 --> 02:38:09,600
People.

2134
02:38:11,260 --> 02:38:14,900
Parents, siblings, friends, lovers.

2135
02:38:15,600 --> 02:38:17,680
The people who were important to him.

2136
02:38:19,160 --> 02:38:23,691
And these people, the
ones left behind, are joined

2137
02:38:23,692 --> 02:38:27,260
together in a great circle by
their shared memories of him.

2138
02:38:27,680 --> 02:38:30,881
A circle of friendship,
trust, and sacrifice

2139
02:38:30,882 --> 02:38:34,200
that grows larger and
stronger as time passes.

2140
02:38:35,720 --> 02:38:37,260
It's hard to explain it.

2141
02:38:37,840 --> 02:38:39,820
We remain in the circle together.

2142
02:38:40,200 --> 02:38:41,640
We have no choice.

2143
02:38:42,400 --> 02:38:43,720
It's important to us.

2144
02:38:45,780 --> 02:38:48,220
So we do it because we have to.

2145
02:38:48,499 --> 02:38:49,499
I get it.

2146
02:38:49,940 --> 02:38:50,940
Sort of.

2147
02:38:54,180 --> 02:38:56,240
Still, I'm sad he's gone.

2148
02:38:56,889 --> 02:38:59,260
Think how sad it would be if he died for
nothing.

2149
02:39:00,569 --> 02:39:02,360
But he left us something priceless.

2150
02:39:04,260 --> 02:39:05,260
Don't worry.

2151
02:39:05,914 --> 02:39:07,500
You'll understand one of these days.

2152
02:39:08,369 --> 02:39:10,340
Hey, give me some credit.

2153
02:39:10,539 --> 02:39:11,539
That much I'd get.

2154
02:39:21,030 --> 02:39:22,670
Bye, Iruka-sensei!

2155
02:39:22,671 --> 02:39:23,671
See you later!

2156
02:39:23,750 --> 02:39:24,750
All right.

2157
02:39:25,130 --> 02:39:26,890
Do you see it, Lord Hokage?

2158
02:39:27,530 --> 02:39:30,370
The will of fire is stronger than ever.

2159
02:39:32,410 --> 02:39:35,456
The sparks you left
behind have kindled a flame

2160
02:39:35,457 --> 02:39:37,930
among the young leaves
of the next generation.

2161
02:39:37,931 --> 02:39:40,550
A mighty flame, Lord Hokage.

2162
02:39:41,110 --> 02:39:42,670
It will burn brightly.

2163
02:39:43,030 --> 02:39:45,750
And it will shine its light upon our
village.

2164
02:39:45,990 --> 02:39:49,710
And keep it warm and safe for many years
to come.

2165
02:39:54,470 --> 02:40:00,370
And someday, out of that new flame,
will come a new Hokage.

2166
02:40:00,371 --> 02:40:01,009
Okay.

2167
02:40:06,478 --> 02:40:33,607
슛 채 いい A little pause.

2168
02:40:43,277 --> 02:40:46,830
..

2169
02:40:46,830 --> 02:40:47,830
and we are back.

2170
02:41:08,830 --> 02:41:16,830
A little pause... and we are back.

2171
02:41:43,730 --> 02:41:46,830
A little pause... and we are back.

2172
02:41:46,850 --> 02:41:48,210
A little pause... and we are back.

